(301960, 21850, 8488, '<td valign="top">The composition gives this shot a distant feel. Which may have been what you were going for, I don''t know. :-&gt; But the way it''s so precisely square, and framed by the bracket, with the subject tiny, gives it a sort of frosty formality.</td>', 'The composition gives this shot a distant feel. Which may have been what you were going for, I don''t know. :-> But the way it''s so precisely square, and framed by the bracket, with the subject tiny, gives it a sort of frosty formality.', '2003-05-19 10:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(301961, 21805, 772, '<td valign="top">very interesting bird... good composition and use of complementary colors as well... The shallow depth of field also isolates the bird from the environment nicely... = 7</td>', 'very interesting bird... good composition and use of complementary colors as well... The shallow depth of field also isolates the bird from the environment nicely... = 7', '2003-05-19 10:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(301962, 21774, 8488, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the complementary colors in this, so I have to grade you down a bit. There''s definitely green, and I could push it to say yellow in the lawn, but I don''t see any other real colors besides brown and silver. In this challenge I''m grading people who put the colors front and center higher than those who don''t (simply to save my sanity and give me SOMETHING to grade on, to winnow the photos before considering Overall Quality).</td>', 'I don''t see the complementary colors in this, so I have to grade you down a bit. There''s definitely green, and I could push it to say yellow in the lawn, but I don''t see any other real colors besides brown and silver. In this challenge I''m grading people who put the colors front and center higher than those who don''t (simply to save my sanity and give me SOMETHING to grade on, to winnow the photos before considering Overall Quality).', '2003-05-19 10:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(301964, 21899, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting use of color and exposure to get your effect... = 6</td>', 'interesting use of color and exposure to get your effect... = 6', '2003-05-19 10:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
