(301968, 21781, 8488, '<td valign="top">The red looks slightly washed out/glaring in the light. Maybe a slightly different angle, postprocessing, or even something as simple as wetting it before shooting it might have helped give a clearer color? I didn''t grade down for it, I just thought I''d make a suggestion for future use. :-&gt;</td>', 'The red looks slightly washed out/glaring in the light. Maybe a slightly different angle, postprocessing, or even something as simple as wetting it before shooting it might have helped give a clearer color? I didn''t grade down for it, I just thought I''d make a suggestion for future use. :->', '2003-05-19 10:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
