(302087, 21477, 7350, '<td valign="top">I like how the whole shot is in complementary colors, but that isn''t really the focus of the shot.  I kind of breaks up the monotony to have the grasshopper in there. 7.</td>', 'I like how the whole shot is in complementary colors, but that isn''t really the focus of the shot.  I kind of breaks up the monotony to have the grasshopper in there. 7.', '2003-05-19 12:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(302108, 21948, 7350, '<td valign="top">I love the subject, love the focus, love the colors.  I guess I wish the shot weren''t so close - I''m not sure how to make it better-I''d have to see the whole playground I guess.  Anyway, I still really like it. 7.</td>', 'I love the subject, love the focus, love the colors.  I guess I wish the shot weren''t so close - I''m not sure how to make it better-I''d have to see the whole playground I guess.  Anyway, I still really like it. 7.', '2003-05-19 13:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(302114, 21955, 7350, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the background.  I wish the orange were more appetizing, though.  Good use of the colors. 7.</td>', 'I like the idea and the background.  I wish the orange were more appetizing, though.  Good use of the colors. 7.', '2003-05-19 13:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(302115, 21955, 772, '<td valign="top">I think this is an interesting composition, but the drops on the orange seem to diminish the theme just a bit for me... maybe not the ''theme'' but the overall visual appeal of the photo... = 6</td>', 'I think this is an interesting composition, but the drops on the orange seem to diminish the theme just a bit for me... maybe not the ''theme'' but the overall visual appeal of the photo... = 6', '2003-05-19 13:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(302116, 21920, 772, '<td valign="top">nicely done... I think this image would have also been excellent with both masks painted the same way... just for fun, i think two white masks would also work very well here :) = 7</td>', 'nicely done... I think this image would have also been excellent with both masks painted the same way... just for fun, i think two white masks would also work very well here :) = 7', '2003-05-19 13:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(302117, 21962, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting photo and a good composition as well... I just don''t see the complementary color theme here... something needs to be complementing the pink and it''s just not here... = 4</td>', 'This is an interesting photo and a good composition as well... I just don''t see the complementary color theme here... something needs to be complementing the pink and it''s just not here... = 4', '2003-05-19 13:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(302118, 21930, 772, '<td valign="top">nice work with the red and green... the background almost looks painted... good work :) = 6</td>', 'nice work with the red and green... the background almost looks painted... good work :) = 6', '2003-05-19 13:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(302119, 21992, 3585, '<td valign="top">I see 20 and 57 in the round ones, nothing in the other</td>', 'I see 20 and 57 in the round ones, nothing in the other', '2003-05-19 13:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(302123, 21831, 772, '<td valign="top">I think if there was a way to put a little more light on the orange ring, the overall impact could be a bit stronger here... = 6</td>', 'I think if there was a way to put a little more light on the orange ring, the overall impact could be a bit stronger here... = 6', '2003-05-19 13:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(302124, 21911, 772, '<td valign="top">this is an intriguing architectural photo... with blue reflections like that, I would have focused on the red wall and blue windows and left the sky entirely out of this particular scene... nice work :) = 7</td>', 'this is an intriguing architectural photo... with blue reflections like that, I would have focused on the red wall and blue windows and left the sky entirely out of this particular scene... nice work :) = 7', '2003-05-19 13:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(302129, 21895, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting composition... I think there could possibly be a little more lighting on the vase.. a good portion of that is being lost to negative space... it would also help remove the feeling that this stuff is floating in space since there is no visible surface... The red border is a bit distracting...it''s competing with your subjects for attention... not a good idea... = 5</td>', 'interesting composition... I think there could possibly be a little more lighting on the vase.. a good portion of that is being lost to negative space... it would also help remove the feeling that this stuff is floating in space since there is no visible surface... The red border is a bit distracting...it''s competing with your subjects for attention... not a good idea... = 5', '2003-05-19 13:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(302131, 21920, 7350, '<td valign="top">I wish the orange/blue one had less weird reflections.  Maybe you could have masked everything else in the room or something? 7, anyway.</td>', 'I wish the orange/blue one had less weird reflections.  Maybe you could have masked everything else in the room or something? 7, anyway.', '2003-05-19 13:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(302133, 21708, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting documentary style photo... maybe photograping one pair of bills would have allowed you to bring out some more interesting detail and create a less literal view of the currency.  = 4</td>', 'interesting documentary style photo... maybe photograping one pair of bills would have allowed you to bring out some more interesting detail and create a less literal view of the currency.  = 4', '2003-05-19 13:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(302138, 21842, 772, '<td valign="top">meets the challenge but looks unnatural to the point that I don''t care for it... I like a lot of digital manipulations, but I don''t care for it in a situation where photography is the primary key...  = 4</td>', 'meets the challenge but looks unnatural to the point that I don''t care for it... I like a lot of digital manipulations, but I don''t care for it in a situation where photography is the primary key...  = 4', '2003-05-19 14:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(302140, 21938, 772, '<td valign="top">I probably would have created a square crop for thi shot... It would make the centered composition seem more ''ok''.   that part of this shot that is in focus is inside the flower also.  That is probably gonna create a lot of ''out of focus'' comments on this shot... = 6</td>', 'I probably would have created a square crop for thi shot... It would make the centered composition seem more ''ok''.   that part of this shot that is in focus is inside the flower also.  That is probably gonna create a lot of ''out of focus'' comments on this shot... = 6', '2003-05-19 14:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(302141, 21994, 4493, '<td valign="top">Your focus is excellent! The composition is nice. I think the red may be a little too orange. Good pic. 7 -danny</td>', 'Your focus is excellent! The composition is nice. I think the red may be a little too orange. Good pic. 7 -danny', '2003-05-19 14:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(302142, 21661, 4493, '<td valign="top">Simple and well executed. Not sure about your cropping. Perhaps and overhead shot with just the tips of the boots at the top of the frame and the blue metal taking up the rest of the frame? 7 -danny</td>', 'Simple and well executed. Not sure about your cropping. Perhaps and overhead shot with just the tips of the boots at the top of the frame and the blue metal taking up the rest of the frame? 7 -danny', '2003-05-19 14:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(302143, 21932, 4493, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Focus and colors are very nice. 7 -danny</td>', 'Nice composition. Focus and colors are very nice. 7 -danny', '2003-05-19 14:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(302144, 21955, 4493, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept. Not sure about the composition. Having the needle fall off the frame in the corner makes the shot more aggressive then it should be I thiink. Maybe a lower angle would help. 7 -danny</td>', 'Interesting concept. Not sure about the composition. Having the needle fall off the frame in the corner makes the shot more aggressive then it should be I thiink. Maybe a lower angle would help. 7 -danny', '2003-05-19 14:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(302145, 21850, 772, '<td valign="top">i really like this photo, but as a complementary colors shot, it''s weak... your complementary colors are hidden in the shadows... I like the way the metalwork frames the top of the photo... excellent work :) - 5</td>', 'i really like this photo, but as a complementary colors shot, it''s weak... your complementary colors are hidden in the shadows... I like the way the metalwork frames the top of the photo... excellent work :) - 5', '2003-05-19 14:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(302146, 21969, 7350, '<td valign="top">These colors are weak at best.</td>', 'These colors are weak at best.', '2003-05-19 14:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(302147, 21937, 4493, '<td valign="top">I like the artistic nature of this shot. Your tones and lighting are very well done. Something seems offbalanced with the shot. May want to play with different camera angles and position of apple in relationship to the kisses. Still very well done! 8 -danny</td>', 'I like the artistic nature of this shot. Your tones and lighting are very well done. Something seems offbalanced with the shot. May want to play with different camera angles and position of apple in relationship to the kisses. Still very well done! 8 -danny', '2003-05-19 14:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(302148, 21920, 4493, '<td valign="top">I only wish the paint on the colored mask was more of a satin finish. This is a great concept and well exposed. 7 -danny</td>', 'I only wish the paint on the colored mask was more of a satin finish. This is a great concept and well exposed. 7 -danny', '2003-05-19 14:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(302149, 21983, 4493, '<td valign="top">The lighting is good as well as the composition. A white sheet held by someone to block the reflection, or a larger aperture to blur it would help keep the eye focused on the vortex on the left. 7 -danny</td>', 'The lighting is good as well as the composition. A white sheet held by someone to block the reflection, or a larger aperture to blur it would help keep the eye focused on the vortex on the left. 7 -danny', '2003-05-19 14:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(302150, 21741, 4493, '<td valign="top">Simple, but nicely done. Good lighting and focus. 7 -danny</td>', 'Simple, but nicely done. Good lighting and focus. 7 -danny', '2003-05-19 14:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(302151, 21983, 7350, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what this is, but I''m distracted by the reflection of some trees/buildings in the green part.</td>', 'I''m not sure what this is, but I''m distracted by the reflection of some trees/buildings in the green part.', '2003-05-19 14:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(302153, 21852, 7350, '<td valign="top">I like this idea, and the focus is perfect.  I think I would have liked a background that contrasted the red apple a little more.  Perhaps just white.  It sort of disappears into this dark velvet stuff.</td>', 'I like this idea, and the focus is perfect.  I think I would have liked a background that contrasted the red apple a little more.  Perhaps just white.  It sort of disappears into this dark velvet stuff.', '2003-05-19 14:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(302154, 21974, 7350, '<td valign="top">The red is not very red, but I like the shot.  The bud seems to be floating out there...</td>', 'The red is not very red, but I like the shot.  The bud seems to be floating out there...', '2003-05-19 14:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(302155, 21947, 7350, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting.  The red is not very red in this shot, but I don''t care. 7.</td>', 'Interesting lighting.  The red is not very red in this shot, but I don''t care. 7.', '2003-05-19 14:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(302156, 21938, 4493, '<td valign="top">From my laptop monitor I could not make out the detail inside. This has some nice tones throughout. I''m not sure if you''re going for green and red as the flower looks pink. The overall composition is kind of ''in your face'' and with the DOF as shallow as it is, it puts the emphasis on the blurred tips of the petals instead of the darker inside. Overall nice flower shot. 6 -danny</td>', 'From my laptop monitor I could not make out the detail inside. This has some nice tones throughout. I''m not sure if you''re going for green and red as the flower looks pink. The overall composition is kind of ''in your face'' and with the DOF as shallow as it is, it puts the emphasis on the blurred tips of the petals instead of the darker inside. Overall nice flower shot. 6 -danny', '2003-05-19 14:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(302157, 21995, 772, '<td valign="top">tough shot to expose... maybe a macro of just the seal and some of the leaf artwork would have been a stronger image... = 5</td>', 'tough shot to expose... maybe a macro of just the seal and some of the leaf artwork would have been a stronger image... = 5', '2003-05-19 14:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(302159, 21780, 7350, '<td valign="top">The background and subject are perfect.  I wish it was a little brighter to make that yellow really scream. 7.</td>', 'The background and subject are perfect.  I wish it was a little brighter to make that yellow really scream. 7.', '2003-05-19 14:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(302164, 21756, 7350, '<td valign="top">What is that green stuff?  Seems like some herb, or something.  Anyway, I love the shot and the composition.  Tiny deduction for being a little dark towards the bottom. 7.</td>', 'What is that green stuff?  Seems like some herb, or something.  Anyway, I love the shot and the composition.  Tiny deduction for being a little dark towards the bottom. 7.', '2003-05-19 14:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(302169, 21992, 772, '<td valign="top">i understand your theme here, but the photo is not particularly inspiring to me... = 3</td>', 'i understand your theme here, but the photo is not particularly inspiring to me... = 3', '2003-05-19 14:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(302170, 21699, 772, '<td valign="top">a bit over exposed maybe... not really making me hungry... i may be missing the idea on this shot completely... = 3</td>', 'a bit over exposed maybe... not really making me hungry... i may be missing the idea on this shot completely... = 3', '2003-05-19 15:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(302171, 21907, 772, '<td valign="top">meets the challenge with blue and orange... I can''t really find much subjective interest here though...  = 4</td>', 'meets the challenge with blue and orange... I can''t really find much subjective interest here though...  = 4', '2003-05-19 15:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(302172, 21661, 7350, '<td valign="top">The shadows of the boots seem to suggest that no one is wearing them, but their location suggests that someone should be.  That just being picky, I suppose.  I think the orange is a little drab - could have been brightened up a little.</td>', 'The shadows of the boots seem to suggest that no one is wearing them, but their location suggests that someone should be.  That just being picky, I suppose.  I think the orange is a little drab - could have been brightened up a little.', '2003-05-19 15:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(302173, 21577, 7350, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the blue is too dark.  I wish it were in the sun, too.</td>', 'Good idea, but the blue is too dark.  I wish it were in the sun, too.', '2003-05-19 15:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(302174, 21937, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a really neat shot... I think I like the backwards theme here... most probably would have approached this idea with a green apple and red lip prints... I think the little reversal of that... nice use of imagery and excellent story telling in this photo... minor detail: Maybe just a tad more space between the apple and the closest kiss... great work... = 10</td>', 'This is a really neat shot... I think I like the backwards theme here... most probably would have approached this idea with a green apple and red lip prints... I think the little reversal of that... nice use of imagery and excellent story telling in this photo... minor detail: Maybe just a tad more space between the apple and the closest kiss... great work... = 10', '2003-05-19 15:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(302176, 21894, 7350, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting item.  It must be some glass piece, or something, judging from the little tiny bubbles.  I like the focus.</td>', 'This is an interesting item.  It must be some glass piece, or something, judging from the little tiny bubbles.  I like the focus.', '2003-05-19 15:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(302177, 21676, 7350, '<td valign="top">Very dark.  I wish the red leaves were much brighter. 5.</td>', 'Very dark.  I wish the red leaves were much brighter. 5.', '2003-05-19 15:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(302178, 21798, 7350, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell where the focus is.  At any rate, it is too dark.</td>', 'I can''t tell where the focus is.  At any rate, it is too dark.', '2003-05-19 15:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(302179, 21965, 7350, '<td valign="top">It''s like a zoo in a flower!  I wish I could see the whole flower, though.</td>', 'It''s like a zoo in a flower!  I wish I could see the whole flower, though.', '2003-05-19 15:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(302181, 21742, 772, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo... I really love the nice combination of color and lack of color in this photo... This photo really does an excellent job of showing an integration of old and new... great work :) = 10</td>', 'Excellent photo... I really love the nice combination of color and lack of color in this photo... This photo really does an excellent job of showing an integration of old and new... great work :) = 10', '2003-05-19 15:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(302183, 21842, 7350, '<td valign="top">Looks almost ghostly.  I like the composition.  I bet this looks great in full color, too, huh?  In fact, I''d really like to see it before the color processing after the challenge. 9.</td>', 'Looks almost ghostly.  I like the composition.  I bet this looks great in full color, too, huh?  In fact, I''d really like to see it before the color processing after the challenge. 9.', '2003-05-19 15:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(302184, 21412, 7350, '<td valign="top">The water droplets make this great.</td>', 'The water droplets make this great.', '2003-05-19 15:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(302185, 21857, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great expressions, but that yellow between the red and green makes the challenge relevance somewhat teneous.</td>', 'Great expressions, but that yellow between the red and green makes the challenge relevance somewhat teneous.', '2003-05-19 15:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(302193, 21831, 7485, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the lighting could be better (the blues are too bleached and the orange in the shade isn''t vivid enough)</td>', 'Good idea, but the lighting could be better (the blues are too bleached and the orange in the shade isn''t vivid enough)', '2003-05-19 15:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(302194, 21920, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great composition, but the lighting looks a little flat (especially on the white mask)</td>', 'Great composition, but the lighting looks a little flat (especially on the white mask)', '2003-05-19 15:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(302195, 21978, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great idea, simple composition. Would a tad more light on the orange hand (maybe backlight) have helped define the shape better?</td>', 'Great idea, simple composition. Would a tad more light on the orange hand (maybe backlight) have helped define the shape better?', '2003-05-19 15:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(302197, 21949, 7485, '<td valign="top">Funny idea, good composition and lighting = 8</td>', 'Funny idea, good composition and lighting = 8', '2003-05-19 15:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(302199, 21866, 7485, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition. Lighting is a bit flat, but probably no easy fixes there (wait for the right time of day + weather!)</td>', 'Excellent composition. Lighting is a bit flat, but probably no easy fixes there (wait for the right time of day + weather!)', '2003-05-19 15:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(302202, 21937, 7485, '<td valign="top">Funny and simple = 7. Only thing I''d have done different is to have more space between the apple and the first kiss.</td>', 'Funny and simple = 7. Only thing I''d have done different is to have more space between the apple and the first kiss.', '2003-05-19 15:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(302204, 21963, 7350, '<td valign="top">I wish we could see a little more green here.  Overall, kind of looks like a snapshot more than anything.</td>', 'I wish we could see a little more green here.  Overall, kind of looks like a snapshot more than anything.', '2003-05-19 15:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(302206, 21948, 7485, '<td valign="top">Good idea, needs a little more contrast?</td>', 'Good idea, needs a little more contrast?', '2003-05-19 15:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(302207, 21885, 7350, '<td valign="top">Good thing you got validated!  I really like it, but I wish the green was brighter.  Maybe if you had done it on a white background instead of black, but that probably would have messed up how you did this, huh?  Still, I''m giving you a 9 because it''s cool.</td>', 'Good thing you got validated!  I really like it, but I wish the green was brighter.  Maybe if you had done it on a white background instead of black, but that probably would have messed up how you did this, huh?  Still, I''m giving you a 9 because it''s cool.', '2003-05-19 15:45:26.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(302209, 21927, 7350, '<td valign="top">Strangely abstract.  May give me nightmares tonight.  I like the lighting of...whatever this is.</td>', 'Strangely abstract.  May give me nightmares tonight.  I like the lighting of...whatever this is.', '2003-05-19 15:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(302210, 21753, 7485, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! But I would have been sorely tempted to force the upper right petal more to the right to complete the symmetry.</td>', 'Gorgeous! But I would have been sorely tempted to force the upper right petal more to the right to complete the symmetry.', '2003-05-19 15:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(302212, 21989, 7485, '<td valign="top">Wow! Now if only the image were rotated to get the flagpoles vertical...</td>', 'Wow! Now if only the image were rotated to get the flagpoles vertical...', '2003-05-19 15:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(302215, 21657, 7350, '<td valign="top">Meets the Challenge:  5.  Pretty good, but the red isn''t really red.<br/>Composition:  7.  I like the diagonal line formed by the tree.<br/>Sharpness/brightness, etc:  7.  I think the focus looks great.<br/>Wow factor:  7. <br/>Overall:  7.</td>', 'Meets the Challenge:  5.  Pretty good, but the red isn''t really red.Composition:  7.  I like the diagonal line formed by the tree.Sharpness/brightness, etc:  7.  I think the focus looks great.Wow factor:  7. Overall:  7.', '2003-05-19 15:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(302218, 21929, 3084, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image, very vivid colours.  8  Morgan</td>', 'Wonderful image, very vivid colours.  8  Morgan', '2003-05-19 15:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(302219, 21885, 3084, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image, very vivid colours.  10  Morgan</td>', 'Wonderful image, very vivid colours.  10  Morgan', '2003-05-19 15:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(302220, 21986, 7350, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the border.  I wonder if it was really all this color of green or how much did you have to tweak it?</td>', 'I like the composition and the border.  I wonder if it was really all this color of green or how much did you have to tweak it?', '2003-05-19 15:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(302221, 21843, 3084, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image, very vivid colours.  10  Morgan</td>', 'Wonderful image, very vivid colours.  10  Morgan', '2003-05-19 15:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(302222, 21947, 3084, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image, very vivid colours.  8  Morgan</td>', 'Wonderful image, very vivid colours.  8  Morgan', '2003-05-19 15:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(302223, 21714, 7350, '<td valign="top">I almost did a shot just like this.  Glad I didn''t now!  The focus seems a little softer than it should be for this.</td>', 'I almost did a shot just like this.  Glad I didn''t now!  The focus seems a little softer than it should be for this.', '2003-05-19 15:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(302224, 21966, 7350, '<td valign="top">I''m eating my lunch as I view this, wishing I had this for lunch instead of what I do have...</td>', 'I''m eating my lunch as I view this, wishing I had this for lunch instead of what I do have...', '2003-05-19 16:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(302226, 21774, 7350, '<td valign="top">I''m looking for the complementary colors here, and I really don''t see them.  If you send me an email explaining where they are (if I just missed them), I''ll come back and look again and certainly revise your score.</td>', 'I''m looking for the complementary colors here, and I really don''t see them.  If you send me an email explaining where they are (if I just missed them), I''ll come back and look again and certainly revise your score.', '2003-05-19 16:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(302228, 21931, 7350, '<td valign="top">Unique idea.  Looks like it could be in National Geographic or something (except the houses in the background).</td>', 'Unique idea.  Looks like it could be in National Geographic or something (except the houses in the background).', '2003-05-19 16:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(302229, 21932, 7350, '<td valign="top">I like the effect on the shadow below.  7.</td>', 'I like the effect on the shadow below.  7.', '2003-05-19 16:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(302230, 21824, 7350, '<td valign="top">Wow.  What is this I''m looking at?  I wish the "orange" were a little more orange, but still cool. 7.</td>', 'Wow.  What is this I''m looking at?  I wish the "orange" were a little more orange, but still cool. 7.', '2003-05-19 16:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(302231, 21990, 7350, '<td valign="top">Gross.  Looks like oily ketchup.  Great display of complementary colors, though!</td>', 'Gross.  Looks like oily ketchup.  Great display of complementary colors, though!', '2003-05-19 16:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(302233, 21895, 7350, '<td valign="top">Needs a little more light and a little less shadow.</td>', 'Needs a little more light and a little less shadow.', '2003-05-19 16:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(302234, 21803, 7350, '<td valign="top">That''s a very blue sky for that late in the evening.  Impressive.</td>', 'That''s a very blue sky for that late in the evening.  Impressive.', '2003-05-19 16:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(302235, 21741, 7350, '<td valign="top">Dramatic, but I think that the colors would be more represented if the lighting were a little more even.</td>', 'Dramatic, but I think that the colors would be more represented if the lighting were a little more even.', '2003-05-19 16:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(302236, 21700, 7350, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a little out of focus.</td>', 'I think it''s a little out of focus.', '2003-05-19 16:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
