(302253, 21500, 7350, '<td valign="top">Did you have to turn up the blue a little in this one to get the water to be so blue?  You''ve got orange and blue, red and green.  And, if you count the horizon as purple, I''m seeing yellow and purple.  I love it.  I think that it needs to be just a little more centered or a little more off-centered.  It''s just enough to be distracting.</td>', 'Did you have to turn up the blue a little in this one to get the water to be so blue?  You''ve got orange and blue, red and green.  And, if you count the horizon as purple, I''m seeing yellow and purple.  I love it.  I think that it needs to be just a little more centered or a little more off-centered.  It''s just enough to be distracting.', '2003-05-19 16:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(302254, 21850, 7350, '<td valign="top">The back of the cart is pretty dark.  Maybe if it had been traveling in the other direction, sun to the back of it.</td>', 'The back of the cart is pretty dark.  Maybe if it had been traveling in the other direction, sun to the back of it.', '2003-05-19 16:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
