(302317, 21911, 3607, '<td valign="top">this is a tough shot because the shadowed building against the bright sky means one is underexposed and the other is washed out.  i think the crop is a little tight, but the building is very nice and i like how the windows came out.</td>', 'this is a tough shot because the shadowed building against the bright sky means one is underexposed and the other is washed out.  i think the crop is a little tight, but the building is very nice and i like how the windows came out.', '2003-05-19 17:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
