(302377, 21947, 6008, '<td valign="top">Wow, vibrant colors, although a little tinged on the pink/purple side than red to me. The lighting really brings out the depth of the image, and the shadows add just enough mood to make it appealing to me. If I were to be very picky and want to change anything it would be the top of the leaf peeking up from the bottom and a little bit more light on the tip of the right flower.</td>', 'Wow, vibrant colors, although a little tinged on the pink/purple side than red to me. The lighting really brings out the depth of the image, and the shadows add just enough mood to make it appealing to me. If I were to be very picky and want to change anything it would be the top of the leaf peeking up from the bottom and a little bit more light on the tip of the right flower.', '2003-05-19 18:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
