(302391, 21920, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like how the base white mask is there as well as the painted one instead of just having the painted one. I''m not too crazy about the reflections on the painted mask, I probably would have preferred shadows instead. That said, the colors are vibrant and the image very sharp and clean, and stands out well with the black background.</td>', 'I like how the base white mask is there as well as the painted one instead of just having the painted one. I''m not too crazy about the reflections on the painted mask, I probably would have preferred shadows instead. That said, the colors are vibrant and the image very sharp and clean, and stands out well with the black background.', '2003-05-19 18:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(302397, 21957, 6008, '<td valign="top">Simple and appealing. I like the curve of the fork and the lines of the prongs. The vibrancy of the yellow/purple really makes the image stand out. The angle on the purple really adds an almost 3d dimension to it.</td>', 'Simple and appealing. I like the curve of the fork and the lines of the prongs. The vibrancy of the yellow/purple really makes the image stand out. The angle on the purple really adds an almost 3d dimension to it.', '2003-05-19 18:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(302399, 21742, 6008, '<td valign="top">The blue/orange building appears interesting just from the shape of it, but presented and framed in this window with the gray walls/shutters it really makes it stand out. The image is very sharp and I love the color of the sky. The only downside is the reflection(s) at the top of the window, and the other ''ghost'' reflection by the staircase.</td>', 'The blue/orange building appears interesting just from the shape of it, but presented and framed in this window with the gray walls/shutters it really makes it stand out. The image is very sharp and I love the color of the sky. The only downside is the reflection(s) at the top of the window, and the other ''ghost'' reflection by the staircase.', '2003-05-19 19:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(302406, 21929, 772, '<td valign="top">i think this tight composition works fairly well in this particular shot... the only real weak point in this shot for me is the green stem... I don''t guess there was a good way to brighten that up some... that would enhance the complementary color element of the photo quite a bit... = 6</td>', 'i think this tight composition works fairly well in this particular shot... the only real weak point in this shot for me is the green stem... I don''t guess there was a good way to brighten that up some... that would enhance the complementary color element of the photo quite a bit... = 6', '2003-05-19 19:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(302409, 21502, 772, '<td valign="top">very interesting composition, but the exposure on the red and yellow seem a little hot... I also think this photo is not a great example of complementary colors... ''orange'' is a complementary color, but it''s complementary color of blue is not available in the shot... = 5</td>', 'very interesting composition, but the exposure on the red and yellow seem a little hot... I also think this photo is not a great example of complementary colors... ''orange'' is a complementary color, but it''s complementary color of blue is not available in the shot... = 5', '2003-05-19 19:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(302410, 21968, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a particularly interesting shot, but I think I''m missing the ''complementary colors'' theme.  The red is plain enough but I''m looking for the green to go with it... = 3 - update... I can see the green on my home monitor just fine... there is a green halo around the head and shoulders... my work monitor is not calibrated correctly... I believe that a little extra boost of light for the green in this photo would enhance it quite a bit overall.... = 6</td>', 'This is a particularly interesting shot, but I think I''m missing the ''complementary colors'' theme.  The red is plain enough but I''m looking for the green to go with it... = 3 - update... I can see the green on my home monitor just fine... there is a green halo around the head and shoulders... my work monitor is not calibrated correctly... I believe that a little extra boost of light for the green in this photo would enhance it quite a bit overall.... = 6', '2003-05-19 19:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(302413, 21657, 772, '<td valign="top">I think this is a nice shot and the composition is strong also... I think it needs to be larger to bring out the detail in the shot though... I would always use the full 640 pixels on the long side when possible... especially when detail in the image is important... = 6</td>', 'I think this is a nice shot and the composition is strong also... I think it needs to be larger to bring out the detail in the shot though... I would always use the full 640 pixels on the long side when possible... especially when detail in the image is important... = 6', '2003-05-19 19:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
