(302509, 21993, 656, '<td valign="top">a hard shot to light well and you''ve made a good attempt.  The specular highlights on the left of the glass don''t add much - often glass is better to light from behind and let the light shine towards the camera - perhaps from a bright background with the light shining on it.</td>', 'a hard shot to light well and you''ve made a good attempt.  The specular highlights on the left of the glass don''t add much - often glass is better to light from behind and let the light shine towards the camera - perhaps from a bright background with the light shining on it.', '2003-05-19 20:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
