(302536, 21857, 656, '<td valign="top">The bold colours make a great background for this shot.  Might suggest cropping off some of the large amount of white at the bottom which doesn''t add much.   Great timing and lots of activity/ life.  (8)</td>', 'The bold colours make a great background for this shot.  Might suggest cropping off some of the large amount of white at the bottom which doesn''t add much.   Great timing and lots of activity/ life.  (8)', '2003-05-19 20:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
