(302539, 21500, 656, '<td valign="top">I like the left hand 2/3rds of ths shot - but right hand side doesn''t add a whole lot.    The fountain is really centered and makes the UT tower seem like an afterthought/ background clutter.  The colours work well though they are quite subtle.  Almost feel it would look better if you took it 5 yards to the right, so that the fountain was against the sky, rather than merging with the buildings and hiding the reflections there , but I don''t know what else is around there then.</td>', 'I like the left hand 2/3rds of ths shot - but right hand side doesn''t add a whole lot.    The fountain is really centered and makes the UT tower seem like an afterthought/ background clutter.  The colours work well though they are quite subtle.  Almost feel it would look better if you took it 5 yards to the right, so that the fountain was against the sky, rather than merging with the buildings and hiding the reflections there , but I don''t know what else is around there then.', '2003-05-19 20:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(302540, 21932, 656, '<td valign="top">wish the shadow wasn''t there in the background - would have preferred a more seamless blue.  Good light, good colours, strong entry.</td>', 'wish the shadow wasn''t there in the background - would have preferred a more seamless blue.  Good light, good colours, strong entry.', '2003-05-19 20:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(302541, 21992, 656, '<td valign="top">colour blindness charts - interesting take on the challenge!  The clutter/  poster at the top doesn''t add much to this.</td>', 'colour blindness charts - interesting take on the challenge!  The clutter/  poster at the top doesn''t add much to this.', '2003-05-19 20:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(302542, 21669, 656, '<td valign="top">good composition, the scarf makes a good sweep down through the shot and the leaves give a lot of texture/ pattern to set it off.    Nice work (7)</td>', 'good composition, the scarf makes a good sweep down through the shot and the leaves give a lot of texture/ pattern to set it off.    Nice work (7)', '2003-05-19 20:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(302543, 21911, 656, '<td valign="top">meets the challenge and the one different window works well.</td>', 'meets the challenge and the one different window works well.', '2003-05-19 20:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(302544, 21641, 656, '<td valign="top">good subject choice but a better background is really needed to help this out.  Strong sunlight doesn''t help the composition either as it has made this really contrasty.</td>', 'good subject choice but a better background is really needed to help this out.  Strong sunlight doesn''t help the composition either as it has made this really contrasty.', '2003-05-19 20:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(302545, 21866, 656, '<td valign="top">nicely abstract and good strong colours and composition.  Might suggest being even more agressive in the cropping and lose the glass, or even the white areas.</td>', 'nicely abstract and good strong colours and composition.  Might suggest being even more agressive in the cropping and lose the glass, or even the white areas.', '2003-05-19 20:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(302546, 21657, 656, '<td valign="top">good colours, and you''ve obviously thought about the background which compliments the leaves.</td>', 'good colours, and you''ve obviously thought about the background which compliments the leaves.', '2003-05-19 20:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(302547, 21578, 656, '<td valign="top">funny title, good complimentary colours and interesting textures, particularly on the green object (melons ?)  The red textures seem either over saturated or slightly out of focus which detracts - I''d like to see more texture in that part of the scene.</td>', 'funny title, good complimentary colours and interesting textures, particularly on the green object (melons ?)  The red textures seem either over saturated or slightly out of focus which detracts - I''d like to see more texture in that part of the scene.', '2003-05-19 20:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(302548, 21931, 656, '<td valign="top">I see the greens, I see the red strawberries, but I also see a lot of other stuff that doesn''t really enhance the picture.  Perhaps a different position or getting closer could have changed things around and brought more focus on the point of the picture ?</td>', 'I see the greens, I see the red strawberries, but I also see a lot of other stuff that doesn''t really enhance the picture.  Perhaps a different position or getting closer could have changed things around and brought more focus on the point of the picture ?', '2003-05-19 20:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(302549, 21708, 656, '<td valign="top">meets the challenge but doesn''t interest me that much.    A very literal and lifeless composition</td>', 'meets the challenge but doesn''t interest me that much.    A very literal and lifeless composition', '2003-05-19 20:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(302550, 21994, 656, '<td valign="top">good colours, interesting texture on the stem, good shot.</td>', 'good colours, interesting texture on the stem, good shot.', '2003-05-19 20:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(302551, 21937, 656, '<td valign="top">the green lipstick seems odd, although it does mean you meet the challenge - how about a green apple and red lipstick ?   Creative idea (7)</td>', 'the green lipstick seems odd, although it does mean you meet the challenge - how about a green apple and red lipstick ?   Creative idea (7)', '2003-05-19 20:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(302554, 21914, 656, '<td valign="top">meets the challenge but the strong, contrasty sunlight breaks up the colours and textures in an unpleasant way</td>', 'meets the challenge but the strong, contrasty sunlight breaks up the colours and textures in an unpleasant way', '2003-05-19 20:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(302556, 21965, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent shot... strong use of complementary color as well... = 8</td>', 'excellent shot... strong use of complementary color as well... = 8', '2003-05-19 20:40:44.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(302557, 21830, 656, '<td valign="top">wow - are these the real colours ?     The grainyness just adds to the great textures and patterns in this.  Cool shot, though I feel it should point up to the right rather than the left - have you tried rotating it around to see how it looks at different angles ? (9)  revised - 10</td>', 'wow - are these the real colours ?     The grainyness just adds to the great textures and patterns in this.  Cool shot, though I feel it should point up to the right rather than the left - have you tried rotating it around to see how it looks at different angles ? (9)  revised - 10', '2003-05-19 20:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(302558, 21974, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent color... the shallow depth of field works very well here also... = 7</td>', 'excellent color... the shallow depth of field works very well here also... = 7', '2003-05-19 20:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(302559, 21947, 656, '<td valign="top">great studio flower shot.  dramatic light, particularly giving the translucent regions.<br/> <br/>Doesn''t really feel like it suits the square framing though - as if it needs some more space at the top. (9) - revised 10</td>', 'great studio flower shot.  dramatic light, particularly giving the translucent regions. Doesn''t really feel like it suits the square framing though - as if it needs some more space at the top. (9) - revised 10', '2003-05-19 20:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(302561, 21948, 656, '<td valign="top">strong, graphic composition.  good colours, interesting textures and well exposed.    Doesn''t hold a lot of appeal for me but you''ve certainly designed a good photograph here. (9) revised 10</td>', 'strong, graphic composition.  good colours, interesting textures and well exposed.    Doesn''t hold a lot of appeal for me but you''ve certainly designed a good photograph here. (9) revised 10', '2003-05-19 20:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(302562, 21753, 656, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours, good use of focus control, though I''d have liked to have seen the whole stamen (? - the white / yellow bit) in crisp focus and the rest of the flower as is.    The soft light works well but perhaps some more back light through the flower would have made this even better ?<br/> <br/>Seems to have a lot of potential as a portrait orientation too - as there seems to be more  interesting details out of the top of the shot than is on the sides. (9) revised 10</td>', 'Lovely colours, good use of focus control, though I''d have liked to have seen the whole stamen (? - the white / yellow bit) in crisp focus and the rest of the flower as is.    The soft light works well but perhaps some more back light through the flower would have made this even better ? Seems to have a lot of potential as a portrait orientation too - as there seems to be more  interesting details out of the top of the shot than is on the sides. (9) revised 10', '2003-05-19 20:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(302563, 21965, 656, '<td valign="top">wow - very ''in your face'' great complimentary colours, lots of texture and detail.  Good shot. (10)</td>', 'wow - very ''in your face'' great complimentary colours, lots of texture and detail.  Good shot. (10)', '2003-05-19 20:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(302564, 21894, 656, '<td valign="top">great background brings this to life.  (8) revised 9</td>', 'great background brings this to life.  (8) revised 9', '2003-05-19 20:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(302567, 21753, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent color and great detail as well... i love the softness of this image.. = 9</td>', 'excellent color and great detail as well... i love the softness of this image.. = 9', '2003-05-19 20:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(302570, 21932, 772, '<td valign="top">very strong color... excellent composition and a unique interpretation... good subject choice... = 7</td>', 'very strong color... excellent composition and a unique interpretation... good subject choice... = 7', '2003-05-19 20:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(302573, 21866, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent shot... the color is very strong and the composition is excellent.. = 9</td>', 'excellent shot... the color is very strong and the composition is excellent.. = 9', '2003-05-19 20:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(302577, 21960, 772, '<td valign="top">amazing shot... this will be a fav list addition for sure for me... i wanna know more about htis shot... great work :) = 10</td>', 'amazing shot... this will be a fav list addition for sure for me... i wanna know more about htis shot... great work :) = 10', '2003-05-19 20:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(302584, 21852, 2344, '<td valign="top">I like this picture, it''s very painterly.  I think it''s the lack of sharp focus in this picture that helps achieve that effect.  That said there are a few small things that stand out... like the lighter spot on the left side of the green apple and the purple spots on the red one.  I like the border too.</td>', 'I like this picture, it''s very painterly.  I think it''s the lack of sharp focus in this picture that helps achieve that effect.  That said there are a few small things that stand out... like the lighter spot on the left side of the green apple and the purple spots on the red one.  I like the border too.', '2003-05-19 21:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(302586, 21742, 2344, '<td valign="top">I''m having a hard time figuring out what I"m looking at... is it a reflection? or is it the inside of a room looking out? I would have cropped off the excess at the right side and the bottom to help isolate your subject a bit better</td>', 'I''m having a hard time figuring out what I"m looking at... is it a reflection? or is it the inside of a room looking out? I would have cropped off the excess at the right side and the bottom to help isolate your subject a bit better', '2003-05-19 21:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(302588, 21968, 2344, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this shot, but the green isn''t noticeable enough. You should try to help bring it out a bit better to get your point across.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this shot, but the green isn''t noticeable enough. You should try to help bring it out a bit better to get your point across.', '2003-05-19 21:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(302592, 21993, 2344, '<td valign="top">Very neat.  A few suggestions/nitpicks.. the glare on the glass is pretty distracting as is that curly thing (a hair?) on the stem of the glass and the lighter shade on the right side of the image.  I would have tried illuminating the base a little bit more to bring out its shape. Overall it''s very well done and I like the glowing blue. 7</td>', 'Very neat.  A few suggestions/nitpicks.. the glare on the glass is pretty distracting as is that curly thing (a hair?) on the stem of the glass and the lighter shade on the right side of the image.  I would have tried illuminating the base a little bit more to bring out its shape. Overall it''s very well done and I like the glowing blue. 7', '2003-05-19 21:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(302593, 21753, 2344, '<td valign="top">I really like this concept.  I would have cropped in a bit tighter though. The focus isn''t right.. it''s soft throughout</td>', 'I really like this concept.  I would have cropped in a bit tighter though. The focus isn''t right.. it''s soft throughout', '2003-05-19 21:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(302595, 21866, 2344, '<td valign="top">This would be great if blue/yellow were complementary colours</td>', 'This would be great if blue/yellow were complementary colours', '2003-05-19 21:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(302596, 21983, 2344, '<td valign="top">you shot this outside.. I see trees in the reflection :)</td>', 'you shot this outside.. I see trees in the reflection :)', '2003-05-19 21:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(302599, 21955, 2560, '<td valign="top">interesting</td>', 'interesting', '2003-05-19 21:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
