(302609, 21914, 2560, '<td valign="top">harsh shadows and the leave in the top left is distracting.  A cloudy day or hold a difuser over the light would make this a better photo.   Nice textures</td>', 'harsh shadows and the leave in the top left is distracting.  A cloudy day or hold a difuser over the light would make this a better photo.   Nice textures', '2003-05-19 21:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
