(302669, 21830, 2560, '<td valign="top">I tend to like natural things to look natural.  good textures</td>', 'I tend to like natural things to look natural.  good textures', '2003-05-19 22:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(302719, 21949, 5112, '<td valign="top">Ximena (8 yrs old) sais: "That''s cool ... and tasty!"<br/>Added note:  Good picture, good complementary colours, nice simple border - 8</td>', 'Ximena (8 yrs old) sais: "That''s cool ... and tasty!"Added note:  Good picture, good complementary colours, nice simple border - 8', '2003-05-20 00:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(302726, 21676, 2634, '<td valign="top">nice but too dark</td>', 'nice but too dark', '2003-05-20 00:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(302728, 21803, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset!  The blue of the sky is amazing.  I like the tree silhoutted at the right hand side.  The thin blue line (frame) is a good touch.  ~9</td>', 'Beautiful sunset!  The blue of the sky is amazing.  I like the tree silhoutted at the right hand side.  The thin blue line (frame) is a good touch.  ~9', '2003-05-20 00:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(302729, 21803, 2634, '<td valign="top">very nice...will be up there!</td>', 'very nice...will be up there!', '2003-05-20 00:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(302730, 21969, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like this picture, even though I am having a bit of a hard time figuring out the complementary colours.  The face looks transparent (I know, it''s a reflection, it just looks that way).  Good job!  ~7</td>', 'I like this picture, even though I am having a bit of a hard time figuring out the complementary colours.  The face looks transparent (I know, it''s a reflection, it just looks that way).  Good job!  ~7', '2003-05-20 00:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(302731, 21989, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice!  I wish the road (is it a road?) were not slanted.</td>', 'Nice!  I wish the road (is it a road?) were not slanted.', '2003-05-20 00:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(302734, 21502, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  The tulips are clear, and the colour is beautiful.  The mattin is a bit heavy for my taste.  A bit weak on "complementary" colour.  Are the stems and green inner border it?</td>', 'Nice picture.  The tulips are clear, and the colour is beautiful.  The mattin is a bit heavy for my taste.  A bit weak on "complementary" colour.  Are the stems and green inner border it?', '2003-05-20 00:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(302735, 21931, 5112, '<td valign="top">So that''s were the song came from ... Nice, the strawberries look juicy and oh so tasty!  I like the line of houses on the horizon.</td>', 'So that''s were the song came from ... Nice, the strawberries look juicy and oh so tasty!  I like the line of houses on the horizon.', '2003-05-20 00:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(302736, 21780, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Reminds me a bit of Cezanne''s paintings, although he would probably have a lot more stuff in it.  I guess that''s one difference between painting and photography ...  I love the way the tablecloth is shaped.</td>', 'Very nice.  Reminds me a bit of Cezanne''s paintings, although he would probably have a lot more stuff in it.  I guess that''s one difference between painting and photography ...  I love the way the tablecloth is shaped.', '2003-05-20 00:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(302739, 21852, 5112, '<td valign="top">I thought they were both sweet.  Granny Smiths a bit less, of course ... Nice picture, love how the apple skin looks painted.  Actually, the whole photo looks somewhat "painted".  Very nice.</td>', 'I thought they were both sweet.  Granny Smiths a bit less, of course ... Nice picture, love how the apple skin looks painted.  Actually, the whole photo looks somewhat "painted".  Very nice.', '2003-05-20 00:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(302744, 21911, 6325, '<td valign="top">Has lots of drama.</td>', 'Has lots of drama.', '2003-05-20 00:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(302745, 21930, 6325, '<td valign="top">Very summery. I like the soft colors in the melon. I wonder if a different background treatment would have enhanced it more - more out of focus or against the dark green.</td>', 'Very summery. I like the soft colors in the melon. I wonder if a different background treatment would have enhanced it more - more out of focus or against the dark green.', '2003-05-20 01:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(302750, 21895, 6325, '<td valign="top">The lemon and vase work well - maybe a little more brightness. And the rose and vase work well. But I think there is one too many elements.</td>', 'The lemon and vase work well - maybe a little more brightness. And the rose and vase work well. But I think there is one too many elements.', '2003-05-20 01:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(302753, 21578, 6325, '<td valign="top">Really nice texture to go with the lovely colors. The green seems to float. Very good.</td>', 'Really nice texture to go with the lovely colors. The green seems to float. Very good.', '2003-05-20 01:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(302756, 21803, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good shot capturing the blue and yellow. Composed well.</td>', 'Good shot capturing the blue and yellow. Composed well.', '2003-05-20 01:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(302769, 21988, 2586, '<td valign="top">This is such a cool shot! Really like the feeling of being among those bowling balls and at the same time i see the whole bowling alley. The shot is lively but not at all ''busy. Nice colors, nice warm tone over the image (wooden floor for example)10</td>', 'This is such a cool shot! Really like the feeling of being among those bowling balls and at the same time i see the whole bowling alley. The shot is lively but not at all ''busy. Nice colors, nice warm tone over the image (wooden floor for example)10', '2003-05-20 02:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(302772, 21894, 2586, '<td valign="top">Sunrise, my foot! :) Anyway, really well done. Like the tonality of your background ''sunrise'' and how it fuses with the colors of the vase. Like the dof of what''s that the base of the vase or its shadows. Beautiful colors. Really has a very pleasing, dynamic impact. Is your whole house in this cosmic vein? :) 9</td>', 'Sunrise, my foot! :) Anyway, really well done. Like the tonality of your background ''sunrise'' and how it fuses with the colors of the vase. Like the dof of what''s that the base of the vase or its shadows. Beautiful colors. Really has a very pleasing, dynamic impact. Is your whole house in this cosmic vein? :) 9', '2003-05-20 02:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(302774, 21974, 2586, '<td valign="top">I really like this image a lot. Yes, i can clearly see it is a flower but thanks to your capture from above it has also assumed another appearance, as your title aptly points out. I love to see flower picture; in last week''s challenge there were tons of them. By now, i am pretty much saturated of the accurate documenting of  ''pretty'' flowers and flowers need to be done with a different take, in an original matter, to make impact on me. This was does that. Beautiful rich colors of the flower. Don''t even know whether it is a tulip or what and i really don''t care. I like the simplicity of the image and i also appreciate originality. 9</td>', 'I really like this image a lot. Yes, i can clearly see it is a flower but thanks to your capture from above it has also assumed another appearance, as your title aptly points out. I love to see flower picture; in last week''s challenge there were tons of them. By now, i am pretty much saturated of the accurate documenting of  ''pretty'' flowers and flowers need to be done with a different take, in an original matter, to make impact on me. This was does that. Beautiful rich colors of the flower. Don''t even know whether it is a tulip or what and i really don''t care. I like the simplicity of the image and i also appreciate originality. 9', '2003-05-20 02:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(302775, 21500, 2586, '<td valign="top">Just wondering: have i seen that fountain, and those towers as a matter of fact, before? Like the subdued colors of the evening sky, seemed to have some LA smog. Colors are very rich and warm. The left half of the image is superb because it has a wonderful composition with the towers and the dispersion of lights. The right half is a bit dark because of the dark building sitting there without any further height differences. Could you have taken it standing to the right of this fountain, just focusing on the left half of the scene here? Just a nitpick and my opinion: that 1 px white border might have looked better if it had been the  yellow-gold in the tower. That white doesn''t appear anywhere in the image and it''s so commonplace. 8</td>', 'Just wondering: have i seen that fountain, and those towers as a matter of fact, before? Like the subdued colors of the evening sky, seemed to have some LA smog. Colors are very rich and warm. The left half of the image is superb because it has a wonderful composition with the towers and the dispersion of lights. The right half is a bit dark because of the dark building sitting there without any further height differences. Could you have taken it standing to the right of this fountain, just focusing on the left half of the scene here? Just a nitpick and my opinion: that 1 px white border might have looked better if it had been the  yellow-gold in the tower. That white doesn''t appear anywhere in the image and it''s so commonplace. 8', '2003-05-20 02:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(302777, 21843, 2586, '<td valign="top">I believe having seen an image in this vein at dpc before. It was a cheese grater i believe. Don''t know what gadget this is but it results in a pleasing, artistic image. Like the tonality and how the light falls on the middle or edge of the whatchamecallit. Artistic. 8</td>', 'I believe having seen an image in this vein at dpc before. It was a cheese grater i believe. Don''t know what gadget this is but it results in a pleasing, artistic image. Like the tonality and how the light falls on the middle or edge of the whatchamecallit. Artistic. 8', '2003-05-20 02:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(302781, 21842, 2586, '<td valign="top">For some reason, this makes a 16th century impression on me. The purple and also the yellow/gold of the image is very striking. Wonder whether that was in-camera or from photoshop; doesn''t really matter to me. It has a very pleasing, mysterious effect. Love that light cloud on the top of the image. The only thing i don''t like,and would have cropped it out, is the moon. Would have cropped the image right below. But you will probably get lots of comments raving about this moon. Also see some banding from compression. Very nice. 9</td>', 'For some reason, this makes a 16th century impression on me. The purple and also the yellow/gold of the image is very striking. Wonder whether that was in-camera or from photoshop; doesn''t really matter to me. It has a very pleasing, mysterious effect. Love that light cloud on the top of the image. The only thing i don''t like,and would have cropped it out, is the moon. Would have cropped the image right below. But you will probably get lots of comments raving about this moon. Also see some banding from compression. Very nice. 9', '2003-05-20 02:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(302786, 21669, 2586, '<td valign="top">Very nice color combination and even though a scarf isn''t normally draped around a tree, it doesn''t have a contrived feel. Could be a nice cover for a mystery novel. I do like the green leaves because they have this aura of surrealness because of their low saturation. Wonder whether you did that in photoshop? Nitpick: the only thing i would have eliminated somehow is the tips of a number of leaves on the left edge just above the scarf. 8</td>', 'Very nice color combination and even though a scarf isn''t normally draped around a tree, it doesn''t have a contrived feel. Could be a nice cover for a mystery novel. I do like the green leaves because they have this aura of surrealness because of their low saturation. Wonder whether you did that in photoshop? Nitpick: the only thing i would have eliminated somehow is the tips of a number of leaves on the left edge just above the scarf. 8', '2003-05-20 03:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(302788, 21920, 2586, '<td valign="top">This image is stark and striking. Great colors; great composition. This has impact for me; like mask imagery anyway. Artistic shot 9</td>', 'This image is stark and striking. Great colors; great composition. This has impact for me; like mask imagery anyway. Artistic shot 9', '2003-05-20 03:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(302791, 21937, 2586, '<td valign="top">I have seen stuff like this before; yet, it''s fun. Nice composition. That apple looks so good that i''m very tempted to take a bit from it as well.  Very clean image. I like square presentations! 8</td>', 'I have seen stuff like this before; yet, it''s fun. Nice composition. That apple looks so good that i''m very tempted to take a bit from it as well.  Very clean image. I like square presentations! 8', '2003-05-20 03:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(302794, 21947, 2586, '<td valign="top">Pretty flowers, pretty leaves, nice colors, nice lighting. 8</td>', 'Pretty flowers, pretty leaves, nice colors, nice lighting. 8', '2003-05-20 03:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(302800, 21885, 2586, '<td valign="top">How long have you been practising to get the jellybeans into the container? :) I really like how clean this image is. Great lighting. Great composition and the trajectory of the beans is well staged and give life to this image (otherwise, i don''t give a hoot about imagery of jelly beans :) Fun image  8</td>', 'How long have you been practising to get the jellybeans into the container? :) I really like how clean this image is. Great lighting. Great composition and the trajectory of the beans is well staged and give life to this image (otherwise, i don''t give a hoot about imagery of jelly beans :) Fun image  8', '2003-05-20 03:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(302802, 21965, 2586, '<td valign="top">This image is troublesome to me and i''ll tell you why. These colors here clash, or in any case aren''t particularly pleasing to my eye. And yet, i bet, that in reality this flower is just beautiful as i have never seen a flower that is not beautiful in its own way of perfection. The yellow and the mauve of the center petals are beautiful, the rest reads as ''too busy'' for me. Maybe what accounts for my discomfort is that it was taken out of context and the overall look isn''t softened by quiet leaves. The dof on the top mauve petals adds to this feeling of busy-ness. 7</td>', 'This image is troublesome to me and i''ll tell you why. These colors here clash, or in any case aren''t particularly pleasing to my eye. And yet, i bet, that in reality this flower is just beautiful as i have never seen a flower that is not beautiful in its own way of perfection. The yellow and the mauve of the center petals are beautiful, the rest reads as ''too busy'' for me. Maybe what accounts for my discomfort is that it was taken out of context and the overall look isn''t softened by quiet leaves. The dof on the top mauve petals adds to this feeling of busy-ness. 7', '2003-05-20 03:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(302803, 21803, 2586, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset, needless to say. Love those narrow mauvish clouds in the golden light. Would have liked to have seen more of the silhouette of the tree, maybe to fill up the whole right edge. 8</td>', 'Nice sunset, needless to say. Love those narrow mauvish clouds in the golden light. Would have liked to have seen more of the silhouette of the tree, maybe to fill up the whole right edge. 8', '2003-05-20 03:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(302804, 21699, 2586, '<td valign="top">Good image, well done. Just don''t invite me for dinner, ok? 7</td>', 'Good image, well done. Just don''t invite me for dinner, ok? 7', '2003-05-20 03:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(302805, 21805, 2586, '<td valign="top">This bird has a lot of presence and the title is very à propos because he and i are constantly making eye contact. Colors of the bird are fantastic, so is the clarity. A little unfortunate is that the color of the perch is pretty much washed out and that the cage lines are stronger than would have been ideal; it competes a little with the bird for attention. But something has to give, i guess. 8</td>', 'This bird has a lot of presence and the title is very à propos because he and i are constantly making eye contact. Colors of the bird are fantastic, so is the clarity. A little unfortunate is that the color of the perch is pretty much washed out and that the cage lines are stronger than would have been ideal; it competes a little with the bird for attention. But something has to give, i guess. 8', '2003-05-20 03:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(302809, 21742, 2586, '<td valign="top">Like this image; it has a lot of atmosphere. Two different worlds or eras are represented here in this small image and that makes for a lot of impact. The dull greys of this building are a nice foil for the intense blues and oranges of the reflections. Great how well the reflections have been handled. 8</td>', 'Like this image; it has a lot of atmosphere. Two different worlds or eras are represented here in this small image and that makes for a lot of impact. The dull greys of this building are a nice foil for the intense blues and oranges of the reflections. Great how well the reflections have been handled. 8', '2003-05-20 03:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(302810, 21911, 2586, '<td valign="top">Nice image with strong lines and intense colors. Good composition. 7</td>', 'Nice image with strong lines and intense colors. Good composition. 7', '2003-05-20 03:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(302812, 21978, 2586, '<td valign="top">Nice image, symbolic but also mildly sexy. The blue female hand is infinitely more expressive, which helps this image a lot,  than the orange male hand. The orange hand seems just the result of a color filter or hue sat; it might have been more interesting if it had been painted as well. The light falling on the female hand is also more interesting than that on the male. 7</td>', 'Nice image, symbolic but also mildly sexy. The blue female hand is infinitely more expressive, which helps this image a lot,  than the orange male hand. The orange hand seems just the result of a color filter or hue sat; it might have been more interesting if it had been painted as well. The light falling on the female hand is also more interesting than that on the male. 7', '2003-05-20 03:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(302822, 21852, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice and crisp looking apples there. I have the impression the red apple is a little too dark, maybe because the background is the same color and it blends in to it. Maybe a lighter background would have highlighted it more - 7.</td>', 'Nice and crisp looking apples there. I have the impression the red apple is a little too dark, maybe because the background is the same color and it blends in to it. Maybe a lighter background would have highlighted it more - 7.', '2003-05-20 04:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
