(302959, 21937, 675, '<td valign="top">very nice job with composition and lighting.  the "line" you created with the lips is quite strong and leads the viewer to the upper right corner of the photo, for better or worse. nice job...7</td>', 'very nice job with composition and lighting.  the "line" you created with the lips is quite strong and leads the viewer to the upper right corner of the photo, for better or worse. nice job...7', '2003-05-20 11:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
