(302963, 21948, 675, '<td valign="top">interesting take on the challenge. i take it you desaturated the middle sections of the "wheel"...the whiteness in the bottom left section of yellow is distracting to me. your focus is good, composition is good, it just doesn''t have a ton of wow factor to me...5</td>', 'interesting take on the challenge. i take it you desaturated the middle sections of the "wheel"...the whiteness in the bottom left section of yellow is distracting to me. your focus is good, composition is good, it just doesn''t have a ton of wow factor to me...5', '2003-05-20 11:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(302967, 21857, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a sweet candid! I love the way they are oblivious to camera and the way you''ve caught the one buy in midair is great.<br/>The horizontal colour strips really add to the composition, though I wish there weren''t such an expanse of white - it''s a little glaring. I''m also not sure about the inclusion of the sides - especially the more dominant green side.<br/>Overall, a nice candid with stronger composition than many similar types of images.</td>', 'What a sweet candid! I love the way they are oblivious to camera and the way you''ve caught the one buy in midair is great.The horizontal colour strips really add to the composition, though I wish there weren''t such an expanse of white - it''s a little glaring. I''m also not sure about the inclusion of the sides - especially the more dominant green side.Overall, a nice candid with stronger composition than many similar types of images.', '2003-05-20 11:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
