(303341, 21714, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like how the jacks and balls seem to be hovering in the sky (with their reflections) very Magrite.  vivid colors - but too loose a composition.  If, as the title implies, they are supposed to be falling like bombs, I don''t get that feeling (perhaps it is the reflections)</td>', 'I like how the jacks and balls seem to be hovering in the sky (with their reflections) very Magrite.  vivid colors - but too loose a composition.  If, as the title implies, they are supposed to be falling like bombs, I don''t get that feeling (perhaps it is the reflections)', '2003-05-20 19:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
