(303357, 21989, 3669, '<td valign="top">This is a GREAT capture.  I love the colors and the lighting in the clouds.  I think it''s neat how the lightening flashed just above the flags in this picture.  I could be wrong but it seems just a little crooked.  Perhaps just a little rotation to the right would make the houses and flags appear more even.  Except for that nit picking thing, this is definately a WOW in my book.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a GREAT capture.  I love the colors and the lighting in the clouds.  I think it''s neat how the lightening flashed just above the flags in this picture.  I could be wrong but it seems just a little crooked.  Perhaps just a little rotation to the right would make the houses and flags appear more even.  Except for that nit picking thing, this is definately a WOW in my book.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-05-20 20:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(303365, 21983, 7628, '<td valign="top">very fluid - is it a glass vase?  It almost looks like paint spraying out over white paper.  The lighting (outside - it see the tree) works very well.  The background is a little blue is it the sky? (you could use the color cast tool to make it white - gray which might work better.  Gorgeous colors, lovely glowing quality, nice composition - colors radiating out from bottom left</td>', 'very fluid - is it a glass vase?  It almost looks like paint spraying out over white paper.  The lighting (outside - it see the tree) works very well.  The background is a little blue is it the sky? (you could use the color cast tool to make it white - gray which might work better.  Gorgeous colors, lovely glowing quality, nice composition - colors radiating out from bottom left', '2003-05-20 20:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(303367, 21803, 3669, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!  The colors are vivid and well portrayed for this challenge.  The clouds are whispy and perfect as well as the lighting.  I actually said "WOW!" when this picture came up.  10+++<br/> <br/>Added:  I just had to come back and look at this picture again.  I REALLY like it!!  Is that a lake in the foreground?  The tree on the right really adds to the picture.  It''s just SO perfect.  I hope you make this picture available for print because I would definately consider purchasing this.  Except, I would like it without blue inner border...the only thing I didn''t like (because of it, you got just 3 plus signs after the 10 instead of 4)  ;-)  This picture better win a ribbon if not first place.</td>', 'Beautiful!!  The colors are vivid and well portrayed for this challenge.  The clouds are whispy and perfect as well as the lighting.  I actually said "WOW!" when this picture came up.  10+++ Added:  I just had to come back and look at this picture again.  I REALLY like it!!  Is that a lake in the foreground?  The tree on the right really adds to the picture.  It''s just SO perfect.  I hope you make this picture available for print because I would definately consider purchasing this.  Except, I would like it without blue inner border...the only thing I didn''t like (because of it, you got just 3 plus signs after the 10 instead of 4)  ;-)  This picture better win a ribbon if not first place.', '2003-05-20 20:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(303368, 21826, 7628, '<td valign="top">a classic duo  - I like the top of the green - full of form and detail.  the red contrasts by being sort of formless - wish it had a little more interest.  I like the composition - just a top "slice"  and a bit of black to set it off.  Focus seems a bit soft at the back - would be nice crisper</td>', 'a classic duo  - I like the top of the green - full of form and detail.  the red contrasts by being sort of formless - wish it had a little more interest.  I like the composition - just a top "slice"  and a bit of black to set it off.  Focus seems a bit soft at the back - would be nice crisper', '2003-05-20 20:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(303372, 21955, 7628, '<td valign="top">fun!  And visually excellent.  I''m impressed you got the green drops to look so green even against the orange.</td>', 'fun!  And visually excellent.  I''m impressed you got the green drops to look so green even against the orange.', '2003-05-20 20:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(303374, 21741, 7628, '<td valign="top">nice colors - very neon - which goes well with the shiny gold.  balanced composition, a sense of depth.</td>', 'nice colors - very neon - which goes well with the shiny gold.  balanced composition, a sense of depth.', '2003-05-20 20:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(303375, 21503, 7628, '<td valign="top">fabulous colors and a creative idea!  The detail is delightful - the weave of the hat, the curl of the hair. 10</td>', 'fabulous colors and a creative idea!  The detail is delightful - the weave of the hat, the curl of the hair. 10', '2003-05-20 20:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(303408, 21774, 8836, '<td valign="top">This photograph is beautiful, perfect use of light. - 10</td>', 'This photograph is beautiful, perfect use of light. - 10', '2003-05-20 21:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(303427, 21930, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nice angle. I think I would have chosen a different color backround.</td>', 'Nice angle. I think I would have chosen a different color backround.', '2003-05-20 22:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(303428, 21824, 3306, '<td valign="top">Different and colorful.</td>', 'Different and colorful.', '2003-05-20 22:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(303430, 21988, 3306, '<td valign="top">Colorful and interesting. Nice symmetry.</td>', 'Colorful and interesting. Nice symmetry.', '2003-05-20 22:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(303431, 21922, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like the subject but the backround is a little distracting. I would have liked to see more of the towel.</td>', 'I like the subject but the backround is a little distracting. I would have liked to see more of the towel.', '2003-05-20 22:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(303432, 21990, 3306, '<td valign="top">The colors are great and I like the feeling of depth.</td>', 'The colors are great and I like the feeling of depth.', '2003-05-20 22:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(303434, 21885, 3306, '<td valign="top">Captivating and original.</td>', 'Captivating and original.', '2003-05-20 22:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(303441, 21968, 7628, '<td valign="top">subtle green - obvious red.  i like how they set eachother off.  nice composition.  might look interesting more high-key too.</td>', 'subtle green - obvious red.  i like how they set eachother off.  nice composition.  might look interesting more high-key too.', '2003-05-20 22:31:34.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(303442, 21978, 3306, '<td valign="top">Creative and original.</td>', 'Creative and original.', '2003-05-20 22:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(303443, 21756, 7628, '<td valign="top">I think I''d enjoy this even more if the leaves weren;t on the strawberry - just the strawberry on a bed of mint - perhaps some clinging to the edges of the berry.  Nice colors - you can almost taste them!</td>', 'I think I''d enjoy this even more if the leaves weren;t on the strawberry - just the strawberry on a bed of mint - perhaps some clinging to the edges of the berry.  Nice colors - you can almost taste them!', '2003-05-20 22:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(303446, 21960, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very novel. what a blue!  great golden orange!  Terrific composition - draws you in before you even know what you are looking at - water rushing over a dam? Wish we could see even more blue, and the white water at the bottom had some more texture.  But this is one of my favorites! 9</td>', 'Very novel. what a blue!  great golden orange!  Terrific composition - draws you in before you even know what you are looking at - water rushing over a dam? Wish we could see even more blue, and the white water at the bottom had some more texture.  But this is one of my favorites! 9', '2003-05-20 22:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(303449, 21989, 7628, '<td valign="top">Increadible clouds!  Very dramatic subject.  The purple contrasts very well with the yellow light.  Terrific how you caught this.  Wish the earthly subject matter was as interesting as the heavenly  (at least more cohesive) But that is a little too much to ask! 8</td>', 'Increadible clouds!  Very dramatic subject.  The purple contrasts very well with the yellow light.  Terrific how you caught this.  Wish the earthly subject matter was as interesting as the heavenly  (at least more cohesive) But that is a little too much to ask! 8', '2003-05-20 22:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(303452, 21955, 4793, '<td valign="top">Cute title</td>', 'Cute title', '2003-05-20 23:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(303464, 21978, 7778, '<td valign="top">why the border(s)?</td>', 'why the border(s)?', '2003-05-20 23:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(303504, 21895, 7778, '<td valign="top">I can see the desire for a border, since the objects seem to ''float'', but why in colour and bold?<br/> <br/>The texture of the rose appears discernibly ''woven'' and ''died'', as I''m sure you know. The vase and orange, however, evoke a more primal idyll - a stunning one at that! I cannot help but regret an aesthetic discrepancy.</td>', 'I can see the desire for a border, since the objects seem to ''float'', but why in colour and bold? The texture of the rose appears discernibly ''woven'' and ''died'', as I''m sure you know. The vase and orange, however, evoke a more primal idyll - a stunning one at that! I cannot help but regret an aesthetic discrepancy.', '2003-05-21 00:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(303517, 21947, 7607, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color and composition=10<br/></td>', 'Beautiful color and composition=10', '2003-05-21 00:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(303520, 21986, 7607, '<td valign="top">Beautiful=9</td>', 'Beautiful=9', '2003-05-21 00:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(303522, 21914, 7607, '<td valign="top">Very nice color and composition=9</td>', 'Very nice color and composition=9', '2003-05-21 00:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(303524, 21965, 7607, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition.=8</td>', 'Wonderful composition.=8', '2003-05-21 00:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(303528, 21885, 7607, '<td valign="top">Good job.Pins and jellybeans stuck to the black background?=8</td>', 'Good job.Pins and jellybeans stuck to the black background?=8', '2003-05-21 00:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(303531, 21929, 7607, '<td valign="top">I really like this composition and you''ve captured that waxy look of the fruit.=7</td>', 'I really like this composition and you''ve captured that waxy look of the fruit.=7', '2003-05-21 00:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(303535, 21805, 7607, '<td valign="top">Such a great looking bird and his color is awsome.=7</td>', 'Such a great looking bird and his color is awsome.=7', '2003-05-21 00:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(303540, 21742, 7607, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo and vivid colors.=7</td>', 'Very interesting photo and vivid colors.=7', '2003-05-21 00:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(303548, 21895, 7607, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked it better without the orange as the flower has orange (or is it my monitor) anyway,nice composition.=7</td>', 'I think I would have liked it better without the orange as the flower has orange (or is it my monitor) anyway,nice composition.=7', '2003-05-21 00:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(303553, 21803, 7607, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done.=7</td>', 'Beautifully done.=7', '2003-05-21 00:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(303560, 21500, 7607, '<td valign="top">I like this but something isn''t quite right and can''t seem to put my finger on it.Perhaps the composition with the waterspout dead center.However,it is a beautiful photo.=6</td>', 'I like this but something isn''t quite right and can''t seem to put my finger on it.Perhaps the composition with the waterspout dead center.However,it is a beautiful photo.=6', '2003-05-21 01:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(303566, 21920, 7607, '<td valign="top">Simple and well done. I keep comming back to it and looking more and bumping up the score again.=8</td>', 'Simple and well done. I keep comming back to it and looking more and bumping up the score again.=8', '2003-05-21 01:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(303657, 21753, 811, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and textures.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and textures.', '2003-05-21 01:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(303663, 21937, 811, '<td valign="top">This shot reminds me of "Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs" for some reason.  Great composition and idea.</td>', 'This shot reminds me of "Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs" for some reason.  Great composition and idea.', '2003-05-21 01:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(303670, 21774, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the shallow depth of field that you use, but the colors seem a bit muted to me.  Maybe some saturation would help?</td>', 'I like the shallow depth of field that you use, but the colors seem a bit muted to me.  Maybe some saturation would help?', '2003-05-21 01:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(303675, 21805, 811, '<td valign="top">Great composition and depth of field on this one.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Great composition and depth of field on this one.  Nicely done.', '2003-05-21 01:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(303680, 21842, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I think if you had been able to capture this when the moon was lower, so that your crop was more panoramic than squarish, it wouldhave been even more effective.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I think if you had been able to capture this when the moon was lower, so that your crop was more panoramic than squarish, it wouldhave been even more effective.', '2003-05-21 01:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(303687, 21596, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the vertical "motion" this shot has.  All of the flowers really make the eyes go "up."</td>', 'I like the vertical "motion" this shot has.  All of the flowers really make the eyes go "up."', '2003-05-21 01:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(303691, 21676, 811, '<td valign="top">A touch more light on the leaves would have made this shot really *pop* I think</td>', 'A touch more light on the leaves would have made this shot really *pop* I think', '2003-05-21 02:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(303693, 21641, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the shadow on this -- it adds some interest to the shot, and the depth of field you have chosen is nice as well.  Overall, though, I think the lighting is a bit harsh and is causing some of the lighter spots to blow out or look over exposed.</td>', 'I like the shadow on this -- it adds some interest to the shot, and the depth of field you have chosen is nice as well.  Overall, though, I think the lighting is a bit harsh and is causing some of the lighter spots to blow out or look over exposed.', '2003-05-21 02:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(303699, 21866, 811, '<td valign="top">The strong vertical and horizontal lines help to emphasize the contrasts here.  Nice work.</td>', 'The strong vertical and horizontal lines help to emphasize the contrasts here.  Nice work.', '2003-05-21 02:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(303704, 21831, 811, '<td valign="top">The life ring is too far up in the frame, I think.  Perhaps if you could gotten a slightly higher perspective it would have been more effective to me.</td>', 'The life ring is too far up in the frame, I think.  Perhaps if you could gotten a slightly higher perspective it would have been more effective to me.', '2003-05-21 02:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(303710, 21957, 811, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  I think either more or less of the fork should be cropped.  It makes me feel like it is missing something.  Otherwise, awesome shot!</td>', 'Great colors.  I think either more or less of the fork should be cropped.  It makes me feel like it is missing something.  Otherwise, awesome shot!', '2003-05-21 02:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(303714, 21857, 811, '<td valign="top">Oh man, they look like they are having so much fun.  Great capture.</td>', 'Oh man, they look like they are having so much fun.  Great capture.', '2003-05-21 02:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(303715, 21885, 811, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  A touch more light would have really help the jellybeans to stand out, I think.</td>', 'Very cool.  A touch more light would have really help the jellybeans to stand out, I think.', '2003-05-21 02:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(303858, 21824, 8682, '<td valign="top">BEATIFUL</td>', 'BEATIFUL', '2003-05-21 07:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(303859, 21894, 8682, '<td valign="top">Wow... the best one</td>', 'Wow... the best one', '2003-05-21 07:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(303975, 21947, 4400, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2003-05-21 09:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(304010, 21947, 7806, '<td valign="top">nice shot, seems pink to me though, maybe that works as well for the challenge</td>', 'nice shot, seems pink to me though, maybe that works as well for the challenge', '2003-05-21 10:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(304020, 21992, 5728, '<td valign="top">The background is a little distracting, you should have moved in a little more, or cropped out the background at the top of the image.</td>', 'The background is a little distracting, you should have moved in a little more, or cropped out the background at the top of the image.', '2003-05-21 10:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(304022, 21774, 5728, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I get the meaning here, but good try, and good luck.</td>', 'I''m not sure I get the meaning here, but good try, and good luck.', '2003-05-21 10:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(304024, 21780, 5728, '<td valign="top">It''s a simple shot, in focus and meeting the challenge. But that special interesting part isn''t coming out to me - 5.</td>', 'It''s a simple shot, in focus and meeting the challenge. But that special interesting part isn''t coming out to me - 5.', '2003-05-21 10:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(304025, 21969, 5728, '<td valign="top">Interesting set up. Did you take this thru a window? The words in the window across the road are mirrored - 5.</td>', 'Interesting set up. Did you take this thru a window? The words in the window across the road are mirrored - 5.', '2003-05-21 10:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(304029, 21947, 6405, '<td valign="top">Beautiful,light contrast and color 10 from me!</td>', 'Beautiful,light contrast and color 10 from me!', '2003-05-21 10:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(304031, 21895, 6405, '<td valign="top">I would go with Yellow/orange border, 9 from me!</td>', 'I would go with Yellow/orange border, 9 from me!', '2003-05-21 10:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(304033, 21894, 6405, '<td valign="top">Very nice,9!</td>', 'Very nice,9!', '2003-05-21 10:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(304035, 21986, 6405, '<td valign="top">i would put whole in focus 9 from me!</td>', 'i would put whole in focus 9 from me!', '2003-05-21 10:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(304038, 21993, 6405, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast,better if you moved glass on left side more 8 from me!</td>', 'Nice contrast,better if you moved glass on left side more 8 from me!', '2003-05-21 10:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(304039, 21965, 6405, '<td valign="top">Abstract flower, 8 !</td>', 'Abstract flower, 8 !', '2003-05-21 10:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(304040, 21843, 6405, '<td valign="top">Kitchen art again? 9 from me!</td>', 'Kitchen art again? 9 from me!', '2003-05-21 10:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(304041, 21938, 8488, '<td valign="top">A good, straightforward, down-the-throat photo of a blossom. The focus is good (I like how the entire flower is in focus, especially the inside where the eye is drawn, but the background is blurred), the lighting decent, the colors nicely saturated. Technical mastery of the medium is displayed, as it were. :-&gt; I can see it as a nature-magazine photo, or something else trying to document that flower ... but nothing particularly makes it pop for me. 6.</td>', 'A good, straightforward, down-the-throat photo of a blossom. The focus is good (I like how the entire flower is in focus, especially the inside where the eye is drawn, but the background is blurred), the lighting decent, the colors nicely saturated. Technical mastery of the medium is displayed, as it were. :-> I can see it as a nature-magazine photo, or something else trying to document that flower ... but nothing particularly makes it pop for me. 6.', '2003-05-21 10:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(304185, 21986, 6097, '<td valign="top">Very nice color.  I really like the border use with this picture.  I think it adds a lot.  Good luck with the challenge!</td>', 'Very nice color.  I really like the border use with this picture.  I think it adds a lot.  Good luck with the challenge!', '2003-05-21 13:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(304317, 21922, 811, '<td valign="top">Good textures and depth of field.  I think I would like more of the towel to be visible.</td>', 'Good textures and depth of field.  I think I would like more of the towel to be visible.', '2003-05-21 14:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(304329, 21843, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the "texture" of this photo, and the contrast not only between colors, but shapes (circles versus lines).  good work.</td>', 'I really like the "texture" of this photo, and the contrast not only between colors, but shapes (circles versus lines).  good work.', '2003-05-21 14:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(304334, 21780, 811, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, and I like how the angle of the cloth/bowl "fits" the angle of the eggplant.</td>', 'Good lighting, and I like how the angle of the cloth/bowl "fits" the angle of the eggplant.', '2003-05-21 14:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(304338, 21798, 811, '<td valign="top">I think a sharper focus would have helped and perhaps a tighter crop so that the opposite corners were more balanced.</td>', 'I think a sharper focus would have helped and perhaps a tighter crop so that the opposite corners were more balanced.', '2003-05-21 14:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(304341, 21993, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice set up, but the space on the left is a bit too much, I think.  There is not enough of it to be effective negative space, but there is enough to make it feel unbalanced.</td>', 'Nice set up, but the space on the left is a bit too much, I think.  There is not enough of it to be effective negative space, but there is enough to make it feel unbalanced.', '2003-05-21 14:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(304344, 21971, 811, '<td valign="top">The tight crop helps to "build tension"  I think a different color of background would have been more effective.</td>', 'The tight crop helps to "build tension"  I think a different color of background would have been more effective.', '2003-05-21 14:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(304346, 21947, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the textures and the dramatic lighting of this.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'I love the textures and the dramatic lighting of this.  Very nicely done.', '2003-05-21 14:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(304348, 21955, 811, '<td valign="top">Good composition, and a very interesting idea.</td>', 'Good composition, and a very interesting idea.', '2003-05-21 14:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(304350, 21965, 811, '<td valign="top">I think that since the lower two petals are not cropped, it may be better balanced if the top was not as well.  Having said that, the lines really draw the eyes into the picture.  Great composition and lighting, as well.</td>', 'I think that since the lower two petals are not cropped, it may be better balanced if the top was not as well.  Having said that, the lines really draw the eyes into the picture.  Great composition and lighting, as well.', '2003-05-21 14:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(304353, 21990, 811, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  It almost looks like the red ooze is suspended above somehow.  Interesting.</td>', 'Nicely done.  It almost looks like the red ooze is suspended above somehow.  Interesting.', '2003-05-21 15:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(304358, 21920, 811, '<td valign="top">The white mask helps to make the orange and blue one even more dramatic.  Good work.</td>', 'The white mask helps to make the orange and blue one even more dramatic.  Good work.', '2003-05-21 15:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(304390, 21850, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective of this, and the way the ornament at the top forms a frame.  I think if the little car thing was a bit more dominant, it would be more effective.</td>', 'I like the perspective of this, and the way the ornament at the top forms a frame.  I think if the little car thing was a bit more dominant, it would be more effective.', '2003-05-21 16:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(304395, 21994, 811, '<td valign="top">Great detail of the texture.  Nice work.</td>', 'Great detail of the texture.  Nice work.', '2003-05-21 16:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(304396, 21477, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the depth of field you have chosen on this.  The "blurriness" balances itself because the front is blurring and the background is blurry.  Very nicely done!!!</td>', 'I really like the depth of field you have chosen on this.  The "blurriness" balances itself because the front is blurring and the background is blurry.  Very nicely done!!!', '2003-05-21 16:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(304430, 21477, 6913, '<td valign="top">Just for your info - grasshopper looks washed out on my screen. Great DOF.</td>', 'Just for your info - grasshopper looks washed out on my screen. Great DOF.', '2003-05-21 16:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(304435, 21960, 6913, '<td valign="top">What is it?</td>', 'What is it?', '2003-05-21 16:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(304438, 21968, 3023, '<td valign="top">Simple. Very complementery! Could maybe have benefitted from better lighting!</td>', 'Simple. Very complementery! Could maybe have benefitted from better lighting!', '2003-05-21 16:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(304444, 21774, 3023, '<td valign="top">Color isn''t in abundance in this photo. i like the DOF in it though.</td>', 'Color isn''t in abundance in this photo. i like the DOF in it though.', '2003-05-21 16:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(304445, 21929, 6913, '<td valign="top">More light on the stocks to accentuate greem?</td>', 'More light on the stocks to accentuate greem?', '2003-05-21 16:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(304446, 21805, 3023, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Although I would maybe have had his eyes not so close to the border. They are the attention grabbers of the photo and it''s a bit weird having to look so close to the border...</td>', 'Very nice. Although I would maybe have had his eyes not so close to the border. They are the attention grabbers of the photo and it''s a bit weird having to look so close to the border...', '2003-05-21 16:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(304449, 21988, 3023, '<td valign="top">Nice symmetry!</td>', 'Nice symmetry!', '2003-05-21 17:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(304450, 21676, 3023, '<td valign="top">That''s very neat! Simple and pleases my eyes! :)</td>', 'That''s very neat! Simple and pleases my eyes! :)', '2003-05-21 17:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(304451, 21937, 3023, '<td valign="top">Hehe! Very nice. Although the picture would even have been nice without the kisses - only the apple! At least fewer kisses...</td>', 'Hehe! Very nice. Although the picture would even have been nice without the kisses - only the apple! At least fewer kisses...', '2003-05-21 17:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(304457, 21842, 527, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors and details. It creates a nice mood.  -T<br/></td>', 'Interesting colors and details. It creates a nice mood.  -T', '2003-05-21 17:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(304460, 21885, 527, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure how you did it but you did it well.  Nice composition and arrangement of the jelly beans.  -T</td>', 'I''m not quite sure how you did it but you did it well.  Nice composition and arrangement of the jelly beans.  -T', '2003-05-21 17:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(304463, 21995, 527, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting image but the lighting needs some work. I feel it should be more diffuse and centered so that the paper edge on the right is not so pronounced and distracting. The two paper edges should both be visible but soft.  The details in the logo would also benefit from softer lighting.  -T</td>', 'This is an interesting image but the lighting needs some work. I feel it should be more diffuse and centered so that the paper edge on the right is not so pronounced and distracting. The two paper edges should both be visible but soft.  The details in the logo would also benefit from softer lighting.  -T', '2003-05-21 17:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(304464, 21742, 527, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo. I always love photos that use some sort of internal framing of a sbject.  Nice colors, too.  -T</td>', 'Very interesting photo. I always love photos that use some sort of internal framing of a sbject.  Nice colors, too.  -T', '2003-05-21 17:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(304466, 21831, 3023, '<td valign="top">The saver is a bit in the dark.</td>', 'The saver is a bit in the dark.', '2003-05-21 17:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(304469, 21753, 527, '<td valign="top">Very clever capture. I think you could have benefitted from an even tighter crop and still show the humor. A little more sharpening would help as well.  -T</td>', 'Very clever capture. I think you could have benefitted from an even tighter crop and still show the humor. A little more sharpening would help as well.  -T', '2003-05-21 17:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(304470, 21824, 527, '<td valign="top">Very nice abstract and interesting texture and design.  -T</td>', 'Very nice abstract and interesting texture and design.  -T', '2003-05-21 17:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(304476, 21963, 527, '<td valign="top">I think a different angle that showed more of the grass would have been more effective. Still a good shot.  -T</td>', 'I think a different angle that showed more of the grass would have been more effective. Still a good shot.  -T', '2003-05-21 17:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(304481, 21894, 527, '<td valign="top">I like this quite a bit but I am wondering if adding some additional glass element would help as a reference for scale or added interest. I''m not sure though. I just feel that it needs something else compositionally.  It still looks really cool with great colors.</td>', 'I like this quite a bit but I am wondering if adding some additional glass element would help as a reference for scale or added interest. I''m not sure though. I just feel that it needs something else compositionally.  It still looks really cool with great colors.', '2003-05-21 17:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(304486, 21477, 527, '<td valign="top">Great capture and composition. Maybe a little over exposed by a 1/2 stop or so.  The values in the grasshopper could be a little richer. This is one of my favorites.   -T</td>', 'Great capture and composition. Maybe a little over exposed by a 1/2 stop or so.  The values in the grasshopper could be a little richer. This is one of my favorites.   -T', '2003-05-21 18:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(304493, 21927, 527, '<td valign="top">I see photos like this and I like abstracts more and more. Even though I think it is slightly dark I really like the colors and the composition.  I''m not quite sure about the wide cropping though.  -T</td>', 'I see photos like this and I like abstracts more and more. Even though I think it is slightly dark I really like the colors and the composition.  I''m not quite sure about the wide cropping though.  -T', '2003-05-21 18:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(304494, 21989, 527, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool photo. I love the way each element is isolated but combine to create an interesting and dynamic arrangement. The slight tilt of the ground helps to create an unsettling feeling. Nice colors and crisp lines. I really hope people give this photo the credit it deserves.  -T</td>', 'This is a really cool photo. I love the way each element is isolated but combine to create an interesting and dynamic arrangement. The slight tilt of the ground helps to create an unsettling feeling. Nice colors and crisp lines. I really hope people give this photo the credit it deserves.  -T', '2003-05-21 18:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(304499, 21988, 527, '<td valign="top">Ha. Very clever. The colors in the background distract from the colors and shapes in the foreground. A slightly different angle may have helped that but it is still very interesting.  -T</td>', 'Ha. Very clever. The colors in the background distract from the colors and shapes in the foreground. A slightly different angle may have helped that but it is still very interesting.  -T', '2003-05-21 18:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(304502, 21983, 527, '<td valign="top">Nice image except that I don''t like the light blue background. I would have preferred a darker background of maybe dark red to really compliment the colors in the scene.  -T</td>', 'Nice image except that I don''t like the light blue background. I would have preferred a darker background of maybe dark red to really compliment the colors in the scene.  -T', '2003-05-21 18:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(304512, 21952, 4494, '<td valign="top">The blue candy is a little out of focus.  Nice shot anyway however, and great lighting.</td>', 'The blue candy is a little out of focus.  Nice shot anyway however, and great lighting.', '2003-05-21 18:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(304518, 21937, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  Lighting is nice, and great job making the "kisses" gradually get smaller.  The one thing is maybe make the bite in the apple look better (bigger, more defined, etc.).</td>', 'Very cool.  Lighting is nice, and great job making the "kisses" gradually get smaller.  The one thing is maybe make the bite in the apple look better (bigger, more defined, etc.).', '2003-05-21 18:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(304519, 21781, 4494, '<td valign="top">The grass is a little out of focus.  Try using a smaller aprature setting.</td>', 'The grass is a little out of focus.  Try using a smaller aprature setting.', '2003-05-21 18:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(304521, 21885, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very cool effect and well done as well.  I''m thinking this is a shot upward through a piece of glass that the jar and beans are laying on?  One improvement might be to make the beans all upright, or at least like the ones on the far right.  Great job!  8.</td>', 'Very cool effect and well done as well.  I''m thinking this is a shot upward through a piece of glass that the jar and beans are laying on?  One improvement might be to make the beans all upright, or at least like the ones on the far right.  Great job!  8.', '2003-05-21 18:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(304523, 21742, 4411, '<td valign="top">I''ve been hitting skip on this one all the way through voting, mainly because that meant it kept popping up and I got to see it lots of times, but also so I could gather my thoughts on it.<br/>This shot defines contrast. The contrast between old and new buildings, between the dull wood and the bright refection, and of course between the orange and blue. While I''m a big fan of sharp modern images, I also very much like shots of old buildings and old wood. You give me both : )<br/>The composition is very strong, it''s framed to perfection and even the pieces of wood protuding over the window are a feature rather than a distraction.<br/>Great shot, good luck!<br/></td>', 'I''ve been hitting skip on this one all the way through voting, mainly because that meant it kept popping up and I got to see it lots of times, but also so I could gather my thoughts on it.This shot defines contrast. The contrast between old and new buildings, between the dull wood and the bright refection, and of course between the orange and blue. While I''m a big fan of sharp modern images, I also very much like shots of old buildings and old wood. You give me both : )The composition is very strong, it''s framed to perfection and even the pieces of wood protuding over the window are a feature rather than a distraction.Great shot, good luck!', '2003-05-21 19:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(304525, 21843, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very cool abstract, and great balance/colors in this shot.  Nice!  8.</td>', 'Very cool abstract, and great balance/colors in this shot.  Nice!  8.', '2003-05-21 19:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(304539, 21831, 7291, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, splitting the life saver in half.</td>', 'Nice composition, splitting the life saver in half.', '2003-05-21 19:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(304541, 21857, 7291, '<td valign="top">GREAT capture!  Compositionally excellent and the colors are there.</td>', 'GREAT capture!  Compositionally excellent and the colors are there.', '2003-05-21 19:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(304542, 21477, 7291, '<td valign="top">Looks over saturated but it''s still a great pic.  Pretty incredible actually.  Nice Job!</td>', 'Looks over saturated but it''s still a great pic.  Pretty incredible actually.  Nice Job!', '2003-05-21 19:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(304623, 21957, 5351, '<td valign="top">Really like this shot - definately meets the challange.  I think the composition is excellent and really like the background and border choices.  Can''t think of a thing to improve it - excellent job!</td>', 'Really like this shot - definately meets the challange.  I think the composition is excellent and really like the background and border choices.  Can''t think of a thing to improve it - excellent job!', '2003-05-21 22:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
