(305284, 21699, 8530, '<td valign="top">Ehhh. Yes, okay, yellow, blue, but they''re not really very prominently contrasty, and honestly, I can''t stand beans, which makes this kinda grody from my perspective. Not a big hit, not a big miss.</td>', 'Ehhh. Yes, okay, yellow, blue, but they''re not really very prominently contrasty, and honestly, I can''t stand beans, which makes this kinda grody from my perspective. Not a big hit, not a big miss.', '2003-05-22 21:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(305286, 21922, 8530, '<td valign="top">Okay, that''s good. You''ve got the colours. You''ve got the nice setup that could be casual. You''ve got the good strong focal point that makes the blur not annoying. And hey, you have teak! Where''s MY teak?</td>', 'Okay, that''s good. You''ve got the colours. You''ve got the nice setup that could be casual. You''ve got the good strong focal point that makes the blur not annoying. And hey, you have teak! Where''s MY teak?', '2003-05-22 21:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(305288, 21983, 8530, '<td valign="top">*tilts head* I can''t figure out what this is, leaving a very abstracty feel, but that does capture the topic completely.</td>', '*tilts head* I can''t figure out what this is, leaving a very abstracty feel, but that does capture the topic completely.', '2003-05-22 21:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(305290, 21502, 8530, '<td valign="top">Mmmm, uh... was this meant for one of the other challenges? It seems more like it belongs in the ''secondary colours'' one. Not really much in the way of complementary here (some green vs red, though).</td>', 'Mmmm, uh... was this meant for one of the other challenges? It seems more like it belongs in the ''secondary colours'' one. Not really much in the way of complementary here (some green vs red, though).', '2003-05-22 21:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(305292, 21756, 8530, '<td valign="top">Hmm. This is a little too staged-arty for my personal tastes but it very definitely hits the topic appropriately and without distraction, so you get a better-than-average vote anyhow.</td>', 'Hmm. This is a little too staged-arty for my personal tastes but it very definitely hits the topic appropriately and without distraction, so you get a better-than-average vote anyhow.', '2003-05-22 21:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(305293, 21994, 8530, '<td valign="top">Ahh, you and the other tomato person should have a talk. Those were redder but the green was weak. This has great green focus but the orange doesn''t suit quite as well as a redder tone would. Interesting closeup shot, though.</td>', 'Ahh, you and the other tomato person should have a talk. Those were redder but the green was weak. This has great green focus but the orange doesn''t suit quite as well as a redder tone would. Interesting closeup shot, though.', '2003-05-22 21:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(305296, 21990, 8530, '<td valign="top">Mmm, looks like bad ketchup on industrial dayglo food tray. No, wait. It looks like spilled... wow, shiny.<br/> <br/>Okay, good use of colour, very strange little photograph, and please tell me you plan on eliminating that shade of green from the planet immediately!</td>', 'Mmm, looks like bad ketchup on industrial dayglo food tray. No, wait. It looks like spilled... wow, shiny. Okay, good use of colour, very strange little photograph, and please tell me you plan on eliminating that shade of green from the planet immediately!', '2003-05-22 21:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(305299, 21931, 8530, '<td valign="top">I''m torn. On the one hand, for the sake of the contrast of the complementary colours, I might say "move the focus in on the berries a bit more!" On the other hand, you''d need a new title and that was kinda funny. :)<br/> <br/>Reasonable, and a pretty picture.</td>', 'I''m torn. On the one hand, for the sake of the contrast of the complementary colours, I might say "move the focus in on the berries a bit more!" On the other hand, you''d need a new title and that was kinda funny. :) Reasonable, and a pretty picture.', '2003-05-22 21:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
