(305388, 21676, 7711, '<td valign="top">beautiful red. Crop off the bottow green just below the last leaf tip, I don''t think its adding anything to your composition. Just lovely DOF too. very rich.</td>', 'beautiful red. Crop off the bottow green just below the last leaf tip, I don''t think its adding anything to your composition. Just lovely DOF too. very rich.', '2003-05-23 00:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
