(305693, 21960, 6999, '<td valign="top">It wasn\''t until I was looking through some of my own shots and saw one of a beach taken from the top of a cliff, making the beach look like it was only 6 feet away that I realised what this was. Not sure I should think any the better of it for knowing what it is, but I do. 9/10 - couldn''t quite say i like it enough to make it a favourite, which is all that stops it from being a maximum</td>', 'It wasn\''t until I was looking through some of my own shots and saw one of a beach taken from the top of a cliff, making the beach look like it was only 6 feet away that I realised what this was. Not sure I should think any the better of it for knowing what it is, but I do. 9/10 - couldn''t quite say i like it enough to make it a favourite, which is all that stops it from being a maximum', '2003-05-23 14:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(305694, 21947, 6999, '<td valign="top">for such harsh lighting you''ve certainly caught the colours very well - especially the green. Think the highlights are a little over-done: makes it look like a plastic flower.</td>', 'for such harsh lighting you''ve certainly caught the colours very well - especially the green. Think the highlights are a little over-done: makes it look like a plastic flower.', '2003-05-23 14:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
