(305731, 21930, 7291, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture.  I like the idea and the composition is great but the crop seems a bit heavy on the right.  Too much grass.  But you may have done that intentionally so I won''t deduct any points.  I can''t help shake the feeling that parts of the grass are doubled.  Hard to explain, but that what I see.  Anyway - 8</td>', 'Interesting picture.  I like the idea and the composition is great but the crop seems a bit heavy on the right.  Too much grass.  But you may have done that intentionally so I won''t deduct any points.  I can''t help shake the feeling that parts of the grass are doubled.  Hard to explain, but that what I see.  Anyway - 8', '2003-05-23 15:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
