(305745, 21993, 7291, '<td valign="top">Nice set up.  I don''t think the choice of border was all that necessary but the picture works well overall.</td>', 'Nice set up.  I don''t think the choice of border was all that necessary but the picture works well overall.', '2003-05-23 15:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(305746, 21885, 7291, '<td valign="top">LOL!!!  Now how did you accomplish that?  I''ve examined this so many times and can''t figure it out.</td>', 'LOL!!!  Now how did you accomplish that?  I''ve examined this so many times and can''t figure it out.', '2003-05-23 16:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(305748, 21774, 7291, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field, but I can''t figure out what the picture means or where the complimentary colors are.</td>', 'Nice depth of field, but I can''t figure out what the picture means or where the complimentary colors are.', '2003-05-23 16:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(305751, 21990, 7291, '<td valign="top">Whoa!  I jsut got done looking a bunch of flat boring images the THIS pops up.  That''s really bright and vivid.  Excellent work.</td>', 'Whoa!  I jsut got done looking a bunch of flat boring images the THIS pops up.  That''s really bright and vivid.  Excellent work.', '2003-05-23 16:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(305752, 21714, 7291, '<td valign="top">Good job having the sky reflect off the glass.  Nice touch.</td>', 'Good job having the sky reflect off the glass.  Nice touch.', '2003-05-23 16:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(305753, 21805, 7291, '<td valign="top">Great picture.  Only gripe is that the depth of field appears to be too close to the lense to ahve gotten the full effect.  The bark is a little sharper than the parrot''s head.  Still, one of the better pictures in this challenge  - 9</td>', 'Great picture.  Only gripe is that the depth of field appears to be too close to the lense to ahve gotten the full effect.  The bark is a little sharper than the parrot''s head.  Still, one of the better pictures in this challenge  - 9', '2003-05-23 16:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(305754, 21949, 7291, '<td valign="top">I LOVE Cheetos!!!</td>', 'I LOVE Cheetos!!!', '2003-05-23 16:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(305761, 21948, 7291, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Are the grey''s really grey or desaturated colors?  I would suggest to have cropped it so the center of the whell is more in a Thirds position, but that may have eliminated too much yellow.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice.  Are the grey''s really grey or desaturated colors?  I would suggest to have cropped it so the center of the whell is more in a Thirds position, but that may have eliminated too much yellow.  Good job.', '2003-05-23 16:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(305763, 21502, 7291, '<td valign="top">Clever use of colors.</td>', 'Clever use of colors.', '2003-05-23 16:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(305814, 21803, 8667, '<td valign="top">How Peaceful!  <br/>So many colors and beautiful view. <br/>Excellent job!</td>', 'How Peaceful!  So many colors and beautiful view. Excellent job!', '2003-05-23 17:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(305867, 21968, 5728, '<td valign="top">Cool cropping, sensuous lips, nice shoulders. Is she married :-)</td>', 'Cool cropping, sensuous lips, nice shoulders. Is she married :-)', '2003-05-23 20:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(305888, 21988, 6523, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field on this photo -- really emphasizes the linear perspective of the bowling alley.</td>', 'Great depth of field on this photo -- really emphasizes the linear perspective of the bowling alley.', '2003-05-23 22:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(305889, 21805, 6523, '<td valign="top">I love the colors on the bird and the photo generally -- it looks to me like you shot through the cage to get to the bird, and having done that frequently at zoos, I know that''s not all that easy to do.  Good work!</td>', 'I love the colors on the bird and the photo generally -- it looks to me like you shot through the cage to get to the bird, and having done that frequently at zoos, I know that''s not all that easy to do.  Good work!', '2003-05-23 22:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(305890, 21949, 6523, '<td valign="top">Great use of complementary colors!  This is a 10 in my book.</td>', 'Great use of complementary colors!  This is a 10 in my book.', '2003-05-23 22:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(305891, 21661, 6019, '<td valign="top">I really like this, a about 1 third cropped of the top would have helped t even more</td>', 'I really like this, a about 1 third cropped of the top would have helped t even more', '2003-05-23 22:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(305892, 21502, 6523, '<td valign="top">This photo is nice but it doesn''t really meet the challenge of complementary colors, which would be blue/orange - yellow/purple - red/green.</td>', 'This photo is nice but it doesn''t really meet the challenge of complementary colors, which would be blue/orange - yellow/purple - red/green.', '2003-05-23 22:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(305893, 21740, 6019, '<td valign="top">I like it, would rather see about a quarter cropped off the top for a stunning pic@!<br/>well done</td>', 'I like it, would rather see about a quarter cropped off the top for a stunning pic@!well done', '2003-05-23 22:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(305894, 21774, 6523, '<td valign="top">I don''t really see the use of complementary colors here -- is it supposed to be red and green?</td>', 'I don''t really see the use of complementary colors here -- is it supposed to be red and green?', '2003-05-23 22:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(305895, 21969, 6523, '<td valign="top">I don''t really see complementary colors in this photo -- there are so many colors generally, you can probably pick them out, but they really don''t appear to be the subject of the photo.</td>', 'I don''t really see complementary colors in this photo -- there are so many colors generally, you can probably pick them out, but they really don''t appear to be the subject of the photo.', '2003-05-23 22:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(305898, 21502, 5351, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo - the concept is really good and I like the composition.  The only thing I would change is the border - just my opinion, but I don''t like the thin green edge - think it would be better with just one color (but I didn''t deduct from your score for that).  Overall a very nice photo to look at!</td>', 'I really like this photo - the concept is really good and I like the composition.  The only thing I would change is the border - just my opinion, but I don''t like the thin green edge - think it would be better with just one color (but I didn''t deduct from your score for that).  Overall a very nice photo to look at!', '2003-05-23 22:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(305899, 21922, 5351, '<td valign="top">Very original take on the challenge!  I like how you set this up and the DOF is really good!  Good luck:)</td>', 'Very original take on the challenge!  I like how you set this up and the DOF is really good!  Good luck:)', '2003-05-23 22:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(305900, 21929, 5351, '<td valign="top">Really like this - I think the lighting is excellent!  Nice job:)</td>', 'Really like this - I think the lighting is excellent!  Nice job:)', '2003-05-23 22:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(305902, 21503, 5351, '<td valign="top">Very cute concept - definately meets the challenge!  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Very cute concept - definately meets the challenge!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2003-05-23 22:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(305903, 21988, 5351, '<td valign="top">Like this shot  alot!  Makes we want to go bowling again!  Good job:)</td>', 'Like this shot  alot!  Makes we want to go bowling again!  Good job:)', '2003-05-23 22:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(305904, 21963, 5351, '<td valign="top">Boating - one of my favorite subjects!  Nice job:)</td>', 'Boating - one of my favorite subjects!  Nice job:)', '2003-05-23 22:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(305907, 21957, 2634, '<td valign="top">interesting composition...color looks like orange not yellow though.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-05-26 19:19:36.</i></td>', 'interesting composition...color looks like orange not yellow though.', '2003-05-23 23:14:40.000000', '2003-05-26 20:19:36.000000', 1),
(305909, 21947, 2634, '<td valign="top">Very pretty...I like the lighting in the green foliage. The light on the purple bloom is a little too harsh. A little close on the top crop. Colors do not meet the challenge though.</td>', 'Very pretty...I like the lighting in the green foliage. The light on the purple bloom is a little too harsh. A little close on the top crop. Colors do not meet the challenge though.', '2003-05-23 23:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(305913, 21741, 2634, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. I would prefer a sharper focus on the top one. The yellows appear to be orange though.</td>', 'Very nice composition. I would prefer a sharper focus on the top one. The yellows appear to be orange though.', '2003-05-23 23:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(305914, 21974, 2634, '<td valign="top">interesting abstract...I would prefer a little sharper focus on the main subject, although I can see you intended it to be this way. The blueish color to the right of the flower is a little distracting. The colors don''t match the challenge though.</td>', 'interesting abstract...I would prefer a little sharper focus on the main subject, although I can see you intended it to be this way. The blueish color to the right of the flower is a little distracting. The colors don''t match the challenge though.', '2003-05-23 23:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(305916, 21937, 1280, '<td valign="top">This is inspiring work!  Excellent! I wouldn''t change a thing.</td>', 'This is inspiring work!  Excellent! I wouldn''t change a thing.', '2003-05-23 23:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(305917, 21965, 1280, '<td valign="top">Great picture!</td>', 'Great picture!', '2003-05-23 23:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(305919, 21993, 2634, '<td valign="top">I love the color of the liquid and the orange. I don''t like the light on the material below the glass-it gives to much attention to it. There is also too much going on on the left top of the glass. I would also try centering the glass or lining it up on the 2/3 line with the orange on the inside. This might balance the photo better.</td>', 'I love the color of the liquid and the orange. I don''t like the light on the material below the glass-it gives to much attention to it. There is also too much going on on the left top of the glass. I would also try centering the glass or lining it up on the 2/3 line with the orange on the inside. This might balance the photo better.', '2003-05-23 23:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(305921, 21974, 1280, '<td valign="top">Great illusionary type of pic.  Unique</td>', 'Great illusionary type of pic.  Unique', '2003-05-23 23:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(305922, 21894, 2634, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful, strong colors here. I like the abstract quality and composition.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful, strong colors here. I like the abstract quality and composition.', '2003-05-23 23:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(305924, 21914, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very appealing image.  I like the way the subject stands out beautifully against the dark bg.</td>', 'Very appealing image.  I like the way the subject stands out beautifully against the dark bg.', '2003-05-23 23:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(305927, 21826, 2560, '<td valign="top">Your Veggies could be a little Cleaner.  Some spot editing will help.</td>', 'Your Veggies could be a little Cleaner.  Some spot editing will help.', '2003-05-23 23:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(305929, 21938, 2560, '<td valign="top">My eye wants to see inside the flower but its a little dark(just on the inside).  The brighter unconnected green on the left is a little distractiong.  The "Rule of Thirds" really does work too.  Nice blurr on the background.  Good Luck</td>', 'My eye wants to see inside the flower but its a little dark(just on the inside).  The brighter unconnected green on the left is a little distractiong.  The "Rule of Thirds" really does work too.  Nice blurr on the background.  Good Luck', '2003-05-23 23:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
