(305939, 21657, 2560, '<td valign="top">your background is a little bright(distracting). A polorizer might reduce the glare from the leaves and show more detail.  Nice composition.</td>', 'your background is a little bright(distracting). A polorizer might reduce the glare from the leaves and show more detail.  Nice composition.', '2003-05-24 00:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
