(306524, 21978, 6900, '<td valign="top">Easily my favorite shot of the challenge.  The blues are extremely blue, the orange is golden and the shadows don''t distract, with the small exception of the inside of the blue hand - which would have been hard to help without overexposing the oranges.  I love the composition - they really are "coming together."  10.</td>', 'Easily my favorite shot of the challenge.  The blues are extremely blue, the orange is golden and the shadows don''t distract, with the small exception of the inside of the blue hand - which would have been hard to help without overexposing the oranges.  I love the composition - they really are "coming together."  10.', '2003-05-25 21:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(306525, 21894, 6900, '<td valign="top">This shot is amazing.  I don''t like the fallen DoF on the bottom of the vase, nor the spots of white in the glass - blemishes I guess.  I hope you picked the best ''side'' to shoot.  Otherwise amazing - 10.</td>', 'This shot is amazing.  I don''t like the fallen DoF on the bottom of the vase, nor the spots of white in the glass - blemishes I guess.  I hope you picked the best ''side'' to shoot.  Otherwise amazing - 10.', '2003-05-25 21:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(306526, 21885, 6900, '<td valign="top">WTF!?!  Can''t wait to see if they are glued on the bg or what!  :)  Excellent, intriguing shot (good idea on the administrator''s note) 10.</td>', 'WTF!?!  Can''t wait to see if they are glued on the bg or what!  :)  Excellent, intriguing shot (good idea on the administrator''s note) 10.', '2003-05-25 21:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(306528, 21920, 6900, '<td valign="top">I wish you''d moved the right mask a TAD right so that we didn''t get the edge of the white one in the orange eye.  And we could see more of the white dude''s face.  I love the contrast of colors and the two you chose are fantastic.  9.</td>', 'I wish you''d moved the right mask a TAD right so that we didn''t get the edge of the white one in the orange eye.  And we could see more of the white dude''s face.  I love the contrast of colors and the two you chose are fantastic.  9.', '2003-05-25 21:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(306529, 21911, 6900, '<td valign="top">9 - would be a 10 with bright blue sky.  :)  I love the color you managed in these windows - and the reflection in the open one.  This is a great find of the complementaries in "nature."</td>', '9 - would be a 10 with bright blue sky.  :)  I love the color you managed in these windows - and the reflection in the open one.  This is a great find of the complementaries in "nature."', '2003-05-25 21:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(306530, 21957, 6900, '<td valign="top">Good shot - the fork is a bit dark and reflecting only a tiny bit of purple.  I wish if you could, you''d have eliminated the yellows UNDER the fork - right hand lower tong and under the handle.  9</td>', 'Good shot - the fork is a bit dark and reflecting only a tiny bit of purple.  I wish if you could, you''d have eliminated the yellows UNDER the fork - right hand lower tong and under the handle.  9', '2003-05-25 21:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
