(788355, 21949, 14986, '<td valign="top">This one has the 3 c''s - Clarity, color, and composition.  I was expection mac &amp; cheese from the thumbnail, so it was a bit of a surprise.  You picked just the right plate to make this look artistic - the blue is the perfect shade and the curved lines really help the look of the photo.   <br/> <br/>It''s not something I would hang on my wall, but for what it is it''s very well done I think.</td>', 'This one has the 3 c''s - Clarity, color, and composition.  I was expection mac & cheese from the thumbnail, so it was a bit of a surprise.  You picked just the right plate to make this look artistic - the blue is the perfect shade and the curved lines really help the look of the photo.    It''s not something I would hang on my wall, but for what it is it''s very well done I think.', '2004-06-30 23:16:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(788450, 21949, 19474, '<td valign="top">I like this the depth of focus it is near perfect... but for the second cheese thing from the bottom it seems to be to close, moved back half an inch it would be fine (or just USM it a bit)<br/>it is great how you picked up the weave in the table cloth<br/>and as the others have said great use of color and composition</td>', 'I like this the depth of focus it is near perfect... but for the second cheese thing from the bottom it seems to be to close, moved back half an inch it would be fine (or just USM it a bit)it is great how you picked up the weave in the table clothand as the others have said great use of color and composition', '2004-07-01 00:06:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(792752, 21949, 19831, '<td valign="top">I have to agree with everybody pretty much. The curved plate is awesome. Very nice lines. I think it was very creative use of cheetohs. The cheetohs and the table cloth have very nice texture. The whole shot I think has a nice "feel" between the textures and colors. I like the composition. Only improvement I can see, and it is minor, is a little bit of adjustment to the lighting. It seems just a wee bit bright coming in on bottom left. It is not very distracting at all, just a thought. Maybe a little editing could do it. It is a nice shot overall. Very pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'I have to agree with everybody pretty much. The curved plate is awesome. Very nice lines. I think it was very creative use of cheetohs. The cheetohs and the table cloth have very nice texture. The whole shot I think has a nice "feel" between the textures and colors. I like the composition. Only improvement I can see, and it is minor, is a little bit of adjustment to the lighting. It seems just a wee bit bright coming in on bottom left. It is not very distracting at all, just a thought. Maybe a little editing could do it. It is a nice shot overall. Very pleasing to the eye.', '2004-07-02 18:51:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(832024, 21920, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very interestimg study and a new take on a universal concept. Here in presenting three colors it evokes the triangle. This adds a completely different interpretation. The standard mask of comedy and tragedy speak of the human realm of existance. In this study it climds to the psychological concepts of whole and split or whole and defragmented. This picture has a strong appeal because of its hidden message. A very good composition and great colors. A way to make this a masterpiece is to use files and sandpaper to correct the cut-outs of the mask. Outside of this, this is a super study.</td>', 'A very interestimg study and a new take on a universal concept. Here in presenting three colors it evokes the triangle. This adds a completely different interpretation. The standard mask of comedy and tragedy speak of the human realm of existance. In this study it climds to the psychological concepts of whole and split or whole and defragmented. This picture has a strong appeal because of its hidden message. A very good composition and great colors. A way to make this a masterpiece is to use files and sandpaper to correct the cut-outs of the mask. Outside of this, this is a super study.', '2004-07-29 14:36:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1118953, 21968, 32259, '<td valign="top">Þetta er ekki ólíkt því að listamaður sé að mála portrett. Flottir litir (sérstaklega græni liturinn). Einföld form. Nánast eins og myndin sé ekki í ljósmynd. Mjög flott mynd. 10<br/>Ps. kæmi vel út á striga</td>', 'Þetta er ekki ólíkt því að listamaður sé að mála portrett. Flottir litir (sérstaklega græni liturinn). Einföld form. Nánast eins og myndin sé ekki í ljósmynd. Mjög flott mynd. 10Ps. kæmi vel út á striga', '2005-01-19 11:25:43.000000', NULL, 0),
